iSixthGen\",\"iPadMiniSixthGenCellular-iPadMiniSixthGenCellular\",\"iPadNinthGen-iPadNinthGen\",\"iPadNinthGenCellular-iPadNinthGenCellular\",\"iPhoneSEThirdGen-iPhoneSEThirdGen\",\"iPadAirFifthGen-iPadAirFifthGen\",\"iPadAirFifthGenCellular-iPadAirFifthGenCellular\",\"iPhone14-iPhone14\",\"iPhone14Plus-iPhone14Plus\",\"iPhone14Pro-iPhone14Pro\",\"iPhone14ProMax-iPhone14ProMax\",\"iPadTenthGen-iPadTenthGen\",\"iPadTenthGenCellular-iPadTenthGenCellular\",\"iPadPro11FourthGen-iPadPro11FourthGen\",\"iPadPro11FourthGenCellular-iPadPro11FourthGenCellular\",\"iPadProSixthGen-iPadProSixthGen\",\"iPadProSixthGenCellular-iPadProSixthGenCellular\",\"iPhone15-iPhone15\",\"iPhone15Plus-iPhone15Plus\",\"iPhone15Pro-iPhone15Pro\",\"iPhone15ProMax-iPhone15ProMax\",\"iPadAir11M2-iPadAir11M2\",\"iPadAir11M2Cellular-iPadAir11M2Cellular\",\"iPadAir13M2-iPadAir13M2\",\"iPadAir13M2Cellular-iPadAir13M2Cellular\",\"iPadPro11M4-iPadPro11M4\",\"iPadPro11M4Cellular-iPadPro11M4Cellular\",\"iPadPro13M4-iPadPro13M4\",\"iPadPro13M4Cellular-iPadPro13M4Cellular\",\"iPhone16-iPhone16\",\"iPhone16Plus-iPhone16Plus\",\"iPhone16Pro-iPhone16Pro\",\"iPhone16ProMax-iPhone16ProMax\",\"iPadMiniA17Pro-iPadMiniA17Pro\",\"iPadMiniA17ProCellular-iPadMiniA17ProCellular\",\"iPhone16e-iPhone16e\",\"iPadA16-iPadA16\",\"iPadA16Cellular-iPadA16Cellular\",\"iPadAir11M3-iPadAir11M3\",\"iPadAir11M3Cellular-iPadAir11M3Cellular\",\"iPadAir13M3-iPadAir13M3\",\"iPadAir13M3Cellular-iPadAir13M3Cellular\",\"iPhone17Pro-iPhone17Pro\",\"iPhone17ProMax-iPhone17ProMax\",\"iPhone17-iPhone17\",\"iPhoneAir-iPhoneAir\",\"iPadPro11M5-iPadPro11M5\",\"iPadPro11M5Cellular-iPadPro11M5Cellular\",\"iPadPro13M5-iPadPro13M5\",\"iPadPro13M5Cellular-iPadPro13M5Cellular\",\"iPhone17e-iPhone17e\",\"iPadAir11M4-iPadAir11M4\",\"iPadAir11M4Cellular-iPadAir11M4Cellular\",\"iPadAir13M4-iPadAir13M4\",\"iPadAir13M4Cellular-iPadAir13M4Cellular\"],\"trackCensoredName\":\"Daily Quote - Positive quotes\",\"trackContentRating\":\"4+\",\"trackId\":586028606,\"trackName\":\"Daily Quote - Positive quotes\",\"trackViewUrl\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/daily-quote-positive-quotes/id586028606?uo=4\",\"userRatingCount\":66280,\"userRatingCountForCurrentVersion\":66280,\"version\":\"17.5.0\",\"wrapperType\":\"software\"},{\"advisories\":[\"Infrequent/Mild Mature/Suggestive Themes\",\"Infrequent/Mild Sexual Content and Nudity\"],\"appletvScreenshotUrls\":[],\"artistId\":382384989,\"artistName\":\"Gopher Apps LLC\",\"artistViewUrl\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/gopher-apps-llc/id382384989?uo=4\",\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/cc/1e/ea/cc1eea02-9dd8-cc06-e96d-fdbb9575e3de/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-6-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"artworkUrl512\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/cc/1e/ea/cc1eea02-9dd8-cc06-e96d-fdbb9575e3de/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-6-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg\",\"artworkUrl60\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/cc/1e/ea/cc1eea02-9dd8-cc06-e96d-fdbb9575e3de/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-6-0-85-220.png/60x60bb.jpg\",\"averageUserRating\":4.76656,\"averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion\":4.76656,\"bundleId\":\"com.gopherapps.affirmations\",\"contentAdvisoryRating\":\"12+\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"currentVersionReleaseDate\":\"2026-07-28T15:17:57Z\",\"description\":\"Unique Daily Affirmations is a free creative affirmation tool that helps you succeed in your endeavors, bring you out from under the clouds, and make positive changes in your life. Through uplifting statements and quotes, you'll believe in yourself with these one-a-day affirmations for daily motivation.\\n\\nHold down the large gray button to reveal your daily affirmation and effectively use the app by repeating the statement out loud.  Saying the affirmation in front of a mirror is even better. It's been scientifically proven that the more stimuli your mind has, the more your mind will retain the information.  By vocalizing in front of a mirror, you stimulate sight and sound.  Envision your personal success.\\n\\nLet these positive declarations become truth in your subconscious mind as you think about it throughout the day.\\n\\nGive us some feedback in the app if you have suggestions or problems.  We really doubt you'll need this though;  just look at all the raving reviews:\\n\\n\\\"Missing one important thing - I think this app is neat but I believe the real power of daily affirmations is when you repeat the same affirmations day after day. A new one every day kind of loses its power because you should be repeating the ones that are important to you so that they eventually become ingrained and change your way of thinking. So, a favorites list would be the perfect solution! If a daily affirmation pops up that you really want to stay with you, add to your favorites and go to your favorites list and read through them everyday. ...\\\" - Tag477543\\n\\nExcellent affirmations\\nThis app provides excellent affirmations to start your day. Every day a new affirmation is generated in which you can use and apply it to your life. I have been using it for a couple of months and it definitely helps start my day to a positive start. I highly recommend it!!\\n-Oceanblue27\\n\\nFantastic\\nI love this affirmations app, it's really practical, it's not just a bunch of quotes like some affirmations apps I've seen. :) well done!\\n-Ladyredfearn\\n\\nHighly recommend this app. - I love this app. The affirmation statements are great and not convoluted. I love the hold button and the slow revealing of the affirmation. Gives you that moment to slow your mind and focus on the moment and truly take in the affirmation.\\n- Hkygal\\n\\nINSTRUCTIONS\\nPress and hold the large gray button to reveal today's affirmation.\\n\\nTap the bottom left icon for options on sharing, saving or skipping the affirmation.  You can SHARE, SAVE, or VIEW the affirmation.\\n\\nWhen viewing your list of Favorite affirmations you can swipe left to delete an affirmation.  Tapping on a specific affirmation will let you view it.\\n\\nTo add your own affirmations, tap on the bottom left icon then tap on \\\"Add Your Own\\\".  Any affirmation you add will appear in your favorites list.\\n\\nTo record yourself saying an affirmation, tap the top right REC icon and then on the red button to start recording.  You can save one recording per affirmation.\\n\\nTo add your own backgrounds, tap on the bottom right icon,  then tap on \\\"My Backgrounds\\\".  Any background here will appear in one of your daily affirmations unless you set one as your current.\\n\\nALL ACCESS\\nWhen you subscribe to \\\"All Access\\\":\\n - Ads are removed (even if you decide to cancel)\\n - Set up email notifications of your favorites\\n - No limits* on Phone Alerts\\n - No limits on the number of recordings\\n - No limits on the number of backgrounds\\n - Set the daily affirmation as a Phone Alert\\n - Set a background and font for each favorite\\n\\n* Notifications are limited to device limits.\\n\\n“All Access” is a monthly subscription that automatically renews at the same cost as the first month.  Payment is charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.  Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period.  Turn off auto-renew at any time from your iTunes Account settings.\\n\\nTERMS & PRIVACY POLICY\\nhttps://gopherapps.com/terms/\",\"features\":[],\"fileSizeBytes\":\"134163456\",\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\",\"genreIds\":[\"6012\",\"6013\"],\"genres\":[\"Lifestyle\",\"Health & Fitness\"],\"ipadScreenshotUrls\":[],\"isGameCenterEnabled\":false,\"isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled\":true,\"kind\":\"software\",\"languageCodesISO2A\":[\"EN\"],\"minimumOsVersion\":\"13.0\",\"price\":0.0,\"primaryGenreId\":6012,\"primaryGenreName\":\"Lifestyle\",\"releaseDate\":\"2011-02-18T04:54:25Z\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Improved automatic text color on background photos — light and dark text is now chosen from the area directly behind your quote, so affirmations stay readable on tricky images.\\n• Widget backgrounds now get the same automatic text color treatment.\\n• Fixed favorites and custom quote lists not refreshing after deleting or clearing quotes.\\n• Cleaned up the Unsplash photo picker layout.\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/80/9c/9e/809c9e14-4685-fe52-99a9-f9e7e1968dc1/mzl.vfvfpglt.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/a8/c8/ae/a8c8aec6-bddb-0a11-4187-1f48ae41685a/mzl.usxwnual.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/b3/15/50/b31550a7-4192-273a-3504-9b13e14a3499/mzl.vldefdij.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/80/74/ef/8074ef25-61d9-25ba-4092-06707630d39c/mzl.xlndpkum.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/b6/23/84/b62384a7-24d6-ddf5-651e-80a912fe87d6/mzl.gwdxiism.png/392x696bb.png\"],\"sellerName\":\"Gopher Apps LLC\",\"sellerUrl\":\"https://www.uniquedailyaffirmations.com/\",\"supportedDevices\":[\"iPhone5s-iPhone5s\",\"iPadAir-iPadAir\",\"iPadAirCellular-iPadAirCellular\",\"iPadMiniRetina-iPadMiniRetina\",\"iPadMiniRetinaCellular-iPadMiniRetinaCellular\",\"iPhone6-iPhone6\",\"iPhone6Plus-iPhone6Plus\",\"iPadAir2-iPadAir2\",\"iPadAir2Cellular-iPadAir2Cellular\",\"iPadMini3-iPadMini3\",\"iPadMini3Cellular-iPadMini3Cellular\",\"iPodTouchSixthGen-iPodTouchSixthGen\",\"iPhone6s-iPhone6s\",\"iPhone6sPlus-iPhone6sPlus\",\"iPadMini4-iPadMini4\",\"iPadMini4Cellular-iPadMini4Cellular\",\"iPadPro-iPadPro\",\"iPadProCellular-iPadProCellular\",\"iPadPro97-iPadPro97\",\"iPadPro97Cellular-iPadPro97Cellular\",\"iPhoneSE-iPhoneSE\",\"iPhone7-iPhone7\",\"iPhone7Plus-iPhone7Plus\",\"iPad611-iPad611\",\"iPad612-iPad612\",\"iPad71-iPad71\",\"iPad72-iPad72\",\"iPad73-iPad73\",\"iPad74-iPad74\",\"iPhone8-iPhone8\",\"iPhone8Plus-iPhone8Plus\",\"iPhoneX-iPhoneX\",\"iPad75-iPad75\",\"iPad76-iPa