81ex'>New skills for ASO and app marketing include new skills: `android-aso`, `app-clips`, `app-icon-optimization`, `apple-search-ads`, `asc-metrics`, `competitor-tracking`, and `crash-analytics`, detailing their functionalities and usage.</pre>\",\"title\":\"New skills for ASO and app marketing include new skills: `android-aso…\"},{\"id\":\"tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/c56d6e53d00d49afb2bd80fd1c63cc8247ce6fe4\",\"link\":\"https://github.com/Eronred/aso-skills/commit/c56d6e53d00d49afb2bd80fd1c63cc8247ce6fe4\",\"published_at\":\"2026-03-15T18:43:23Z\",\"summary\":\"<pre style='white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex'>Update README with new links and web version info\\n\\nUpdated links and added information about the web version powered by LLMs.</pre>\",\"title\":\"Update README with new links and web version info\"},{\"id\":\"tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/087fe17e42bcb59c5d92294af705ed4abd7b568c\",\"link\":\"https://github.com/Eronred/aso-skills/commit/087fe17e42bcb59c5d92294af705ed4abd7b568c\",\"published_at\":\"2026-03-05T15:58:36Z\",\"summary\":\"<pre style='white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex'>Include new market intelligence skills. Add market movers and market activity tools to the registry and integrations documentation. Update API documentation for market tracking features.</pre>\",\"title\":\"Include new market intelligence skills. Add market movers and market …\"},{\"id\":\"tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/830b7da309290ab82cb7d87cb815c5363b3dd202\",\"link\":\"https://github.com/Eronred/aso-skills/commit/830b7da309290ab82cb7d87cb815c5363b3dd202\",\"published_at\":\"2026-02-28T09:51:00Z\",\"summary\":\"<pre style='white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex'>fix readme</pre>\",\"title\":\"fix readme\"},{\"id\":\"tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/e5406dd218650092dd9c68dca2b108a29fcff2ab\",\"link\":\"https://github.com/Eronred/aso-skills/commit/e5406dd218650092dd9c68dca2b108a29fcff2ab\",\"published_at\":\"2026-02-28T00:02:31Z\",\"summary\":\"<pre style='white-space:pre-wrap;width