\"type\":\"profile\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/3Imzdo3\",\"verification\":{\"type\":\"individual\",\"verified\":true,\"verified_at\":null},\"website\":{\"display_url\":\"lin.ee/cnl9M18\",\"url\":\"https://lin.ee/cnl9M18\"}},\"bookmarks\":601,\"community_note\":null,\"created_at\":\"Mon Jul 27 09:10:20 +0000 2026\",\"created_timestamp\":1785143420,\"embed_card\":\"tweet\",\"id\":\"2081668498338807900\",\"is_note_tweet\":false,\"lang\":null,\"likes\":174,\"media\":{},\"possibly_sensitive\":false,\"provider\":\"twitter\",\"quotes\":10,\"raw_text\":{\"display_text_range\":[0,23],\"facets\":[],\"text\":\"https://t.co/LffcPuFRzi\"},\"replies\":0,\"replying_to\":null,\"reposted_by\":null,\"reposts\":9,\"source\":\"Twitter Web App\",\"text\":\"\",\"type\":\"status\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/3Imzdo3/status/2081668498338807900\",\"views\":95193}]}},\"reason\":null,\"source_id\":\"x.3imzdo3-articles\",\"status\":\"success\"},\"schema_version\":\"marketing.source-capture.v1\",\"source\":{\"adapter\":\"x_articles\",\"cadence\":\"daily\",\"enabled\":true,\"handle\":\"3Imzdo3\",\"id\":\"x.3imzdo3-articles\",\"languages\":[\"ja\"],\"limit\":5,\"product_ids\":[\"ebook-ja\",\"ebook-en\"]}}}\n{\"file\":\"/Users/anicca/anicca/skills/earn/marketing-engine/evidence/intel/pulls/68f5220fe826411ab0d41408bda1f09e/x.ernesto-software-articles.json\",\"keys\":[\"result\",\"schema_version\",\"source\"],\"item\":{\"result\":{\"api_status\":200,\"cache\":{},\"canonical_url\":\"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\",\"error_class\":null,\"http_status\":200,\"item_ids\":[\"x:2082527284301300023\",\"x:2067994710841360596\",\"x:2062582178236727320\",\"x:2056740238890766383\",\"x:2055380685452640538\"],\"payload\":{\"articles\":[{\"article\":{\"content\":{\"blocks\":[{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"7qrp2\",\"text\":\"Our app is currently doing $50,000/week. \\nThis month we will wrap up at $150K MRR.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":0,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"64orr\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"cnblf\",\"text\":\"and thats just 1 of my businesses, I have have many others \\n\\nbringing in over $200k/mo in personal income.and all of these businesses are built on the back of claude.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":1,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"ddoqh\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"34hat\",\"text\":\"Claude is literally my COO.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"8i2md\",\"text\":\"and yet 99% of people still use Claude like an assistant,\\nto help them with basic tasks.\\n\\nat this point thats caveman behavior.\\n\\nThe reason i'm able to run so many \\n6 figure/mo business at once\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"87c0t\",\"text\":\"boils down to the precision in which I use Claude. \\nand thats exactly what i will break down in this article\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"384t3\",\"text\":\"STEP 1: MCP MAXING\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"caunq\",\"text\":\"The first step to get above average results with Claude\\nIs to give claude access to useful MCPS:\\n\\nMCP's are like super powers for Claude\\nFor example, recently i tried re creating a very famous game\\n\\nThat has over 4 Billion downloads\\nI sent the same prompt to 2 agents\\n\\n1 claude agent had access to 2 MCPS   \\n( higgsfield MCP for images + meshy AI for 3d models )\\n\\nThe other agent had no access to mcps.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":2,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"19i1q\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"cm3s5\",\"text\":\"The results speak for themselves.\\n\\nthe agent with access to MCP delivered exceptional results \\ncompared to the other agent.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"length\":29,\"offset\":0,\"style\":\"Bold\"}],\"key\":\"4ith9\",\"text\":\"SO WHICH MCPS SHOULD YOU GET?\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"length\":38,\"offset\":30,\"style\":\"Bold\"}],\"key\":\"av60j\",\"text\":\"Lets say you want to build a  SAAS that turns images into 3D models.\\nI'll send Claude a prompt like this:\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":3,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1hf5b\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"4ecmj\",\"text\":\"My Claude code agent is connected to all of these MCPS by default:\\n\\n→  Dribbble API to research visual direction\\n→ Higgsfield MCP for every image gen and video gen model\\n→ Blender MCP to make 3D assets for games\\n→ Vercel MCP to host the website\\n→ Resend API to send emails (login codes, receipts, everything)\\n→ Supabase MCP to spin up the database\\n→ GoDaddy MCP to manage DNS records\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"length\":54,\"offset\":0,\"style\":\"Bold\"},{\"length\":51,\"offset\":131,\"style\":\"Bold\"},{\"length\":38,\"offset\":281,\"style\":\"Bold\"}],\"key\":\"8uk23\",\"text\":\"so now instead of wasting days setting \\neverything up myself \\n\\nClaude handles it all.  \\n\\nbut even with all these super powers\\n\\nyou would still need to be sending 1 prompt at a time. \\nbecause AI has a cap on how many tokens it can spend per prompt.\\n\\nthats when the loops comes in.\\n\\nCLAUDE LOOPS + MCPS = SUPER EFFICIENCY\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":4,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"b3469\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"cnl5a\",\"text\":\"Instead of prompting 1 prompt a time,\\nYou can run this fun little command inside claude code \\n\\n/loop \\n\\nbasically this makes claude automatically \\nprompts itself over and over again for hours.\\n\\nIt writes the code, tests it, sees what broke, fixes it, tests again.\\nuntil it achieves the goal you set for it.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"ekd64\",\"text\":\"This is how I build all of my websites, apps and businesses:\\n\\n→Claude Code \\n→Opus 5\\n→Ultra think mode \\n→/loop command\\n→ + a text file called TASKS.md \\nwhich sets the goal that claude has to achieve\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"9vo1o\",\"text\":\"rules for a clean loop\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"jcj1\",\"text\":\"→ Write TASKS.md like you are briefing a junior developer.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"3gghf\",\"text\":\"Vague goals = vague output.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"h9r\",\"text\":\"→ Give each task one clear outcome.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1glbj\",\"text\":\"“Deploy the app to Vercel”\\nnot “Make the app better.”\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"fc8ms\",\"text\":\"You have to be extremely specific.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"16rno\",\"text\":\"→ Put spending limits on every API key.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"7teqf\",\"text\":\"Claude will burn through your credits\\nif you let it.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"4dvl1\",\"text\":\"→ Run the loop inside a sandboxed folder.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"2u50i\",\"text\":\"Never point /loop at your main repository.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"84icv\",\"text\":\"→ Add a kill switch using a MAX_RUNTIME variable.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"31rnf\",\"text\":\"I usually cap mine at 12 hours.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"6mhd1\",\"text\":\"If it still has not shipped by then,\\nsomething is probably wrong.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5da2u\",\"text\":\"Now here is where loops and MCPs\\nget even crazier.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"dkphm\",\"text\":\"You do not have to run just one loop at a time.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1utst\",\"text\":\"You can run multiple loops in parallel.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"8elhl\",\"text\":\"Loop 1 builds the app.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5sjur\",\"text\":\"Loop 2 generates 50 pieces of UGC\\nto promote the app.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"fobrl\",\"text\":\"For example:\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"8r2tf\",\"text\":\"I recently built a brand-new app\\nusing a Claude loop.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"ep64o\",\"text\":\"And this is how it turned out:\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":5,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"49fk5\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5cjc2\",\"text\":\"then in parallel I ran another loop that made a bunch of different ads with Higgsfield MCP and it made me a bunch of professional UGC ads that i can now use to promote the app.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":6,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"7st08\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"fh2ma\",\"text\":\"And all of this took 10 minutes of my attention, set the loops off \\nAnd forgot about it, welcome to the future.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"26fl8\",\"text\":\"BUILDING SYSTEMS WITH CLAUDE:\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"3ng2h\",\"text\":\"We covered MCP maxxing\\nand loop maxxing with Claude.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"bb6jn\",\"text\":\"But another way I abuse Claude\\nis by using it to build systems.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"658qb\",\"text\":\"Most parts of a business can be automated.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"8qj04\",\"text\":\"The more you automate,\\nthe more you can handle\\nwithout needing a massive team.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"bvj99\",\"text\":\"For example, I had Claude build a complete content system for my UGC team.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"bc1jg\",\"text\":\"It includes:\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"7gv88\",\"text\":\"→ Daily videos for creators to record\\n→ Scripts for every video\\n→ Step-by-step recording instructions\\n→ Tools that help them create better content\\n→ A full content calendar that keeps everything organized\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"d61u5\",\"text\":\"Because of this system,\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"aqt7e\",\"text\":\"we are able to run a team of 20+ UGC creators\\nwithout needing managers or extra hands.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1m4p0\",\"text\":\"It is almost completely automated.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5jmqc\",\"text\":\"And that is just one of the hundreds of systems\\nI have integrated across all of my companies.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"a8pkb\",\"text\":\"So ask yourself:\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"6jcit\",\"text\":\"What part of my business am I still doing manually\\nthat Claude could turn into a system?\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"a8l2c\",\"text\":\"Then run a /loop\\nand have Claude build the automation for you.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"86l6b\",\"text\":\"THE $1M OPPORTUNITY\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5k9un\",\"text\":\"Most people are still using Claude\\n\\nto write emails, summarize documents,\\nand complete basic tasks.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"7fddm\",\"text\":\"But that is barely scratching the surface.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"6cpi6\",\"text\":\"The real opportunity is using Claude\\nto build products, create content, automate operations,\\nand run entire parts of your business.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"eso3l\",\"text\":\"MCPs give Claude access to better tools.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"bqeqj\",\"text\":\"Loops give Claude the ability\\nto keep working until the job is finished.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"8bogf\",\"text\":\"Systems turn that work\\ninto something your business can use every day.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"cigp2\",\"text\":\"When you combine all three,\\nClaude stops being an assistant.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1bufc\",\"text\":\"It becomes an operator.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"ap8i4\",\"text\":\"That is how I am able to run multiple businesses\\nwithout needing a massive team\\nor spending every hour managing people.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"dshjp\",\"text\":\"And we are still extremely early.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"ffen5\",\"text\":\"So stop asking Claude\\nto help you complete random tasks.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"9djo0\",\"text\":\"Give it a real goal.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"c1hq9\",\"text\":\"Connect it to the right tools.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"3hne5\",\"text\":\"Put it inside a loop.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"ea49l\",\"text\":\"And have it build a system\\nthat continues creating value long after you close your laptop.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"s0ep\",\"text\":\"The people who understand this now\\nare going to have an unfair advantage\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"c3imi\",\"text\":\"over everyone who still thinks AI is just a chatbot.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"}],\"entityMap\":[{\"key\":\"4\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"e319e9e4-b8ed-4b8b-90f8-da3d5ae8742a\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"5\",\"mediaCategory\":\"DraftTweetImage\",\"mediaId\":\"2082450513891643392\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"5\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"adfd8182-5805-4bf7-a80b-461e10a5b748\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"12\",\"mediaCategory\":\"AmplifyVideo\",\"mediaId\":\"2082451034341834752\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"6\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"3c681835-780d-4052-9a8a-0396c20c095f\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"13\",\"mediaCategory\":\"AmplifyVideo\",\"mediaId\":\"2082451054243774464\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"1\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"7216938e-d793-4a2c-94a6-eef75033e003\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"10\",\"mediaCategory\":\"DraftTweetImage\",\"mediaId\":\"2082527603118809088\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"0\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"f553c05d-e6cc-4dd9-9620-d2087677390c\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"8\",\"mediaCategory\":\"DraftTweetImage\",\"mediaId\":\"2082527563184803840\"}]},\"muta