\"ErnestoSOFTWARE\",\"statuses\":7090,\"type\":\"profile\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\",\"verification\":{\"type\":\"individual\",\"verified\":true,\"verified_at\":null},\"website\":null},\"bookmarks\":2005,\"community_note\":null,\"created_at\":\"Wed Jul 29 18:02:50 +0000 2026\",\"created_timestamp\":1785348170,\"embed_card\":\"tweet\",\"id\":\"2082527284301300023\",\"is_note_tweet\":false,\"lang\":null,\"likes\":562,\"media\":{},\"possibly_sensitive\":false,\"provider\":\"twitter\",\"quotes\":7,\"raw_text\":{\"display_text_range\":[0,23],\"facets\":[],\"text\":\"https://t.co/bI99JKujeH\"},\"replies\":24,\"replying_to\":null,\"reposted_by\":null,\"reposts\":48,\"source\":\"Twitter Web App\",\"text\":\"\",\"type\":\"status\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE/status/2082527284301300023\",\"views\":310902},{\"article\":{\"content\":{\"blocks\":[{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"6r4ll\",\"text\":\"There is an app called 75HER pulling $200,000 a month right now, Go look at their TikTok videos, Every video looks like a real women sharing their before and after transformation.... yet none of those women are real.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"c11k8\",\"text\":\"Every creator in their UGC program is an AI character. \\nThis is only the beginning of the future\\n\\na new form of marketing is here, \\nand this app is only proof of how powerful it already is.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":0,\"length\":6,\"offset\":126}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"fudar\",\"text\":\"Im this article I am going to break down exactly how 75HER does this, \\nand how you copy the whole system for your app \\n\\nusing Arcads MCP Step by step.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":1,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"8ts82\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"c8vqc\",\"text\":\"How the 75HER app makes $200k/mo\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"7murp\",\"text\":\"75HER is a women's fitness app built around the 75 Hard challenge.\\nbut targeting only women, which is a great choice \\n\\nConsidering women are some of the most impulsive buyers. \\nwhich is part of the reason they are printing $200k/mo\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":2,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"cidcs\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"2dkt3\",\"text\":\"Their whole content strategy is drastic before and afters of the women\\n\\nbefore being fat \\nafter being ripped  \\n\\nwhich is VERY easy to do with AI \\nnot only is this content strategy genius, but its also very profitable.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1bu9j\",\"text\":\"Real human UGC runs $15-25 per video \\nAI UGC videos: $0.20 cents per video\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"4b4fk\",\"text\":\"so not only are they at $200k/mo their margins are probably insane. \\nSince they don't have to spend that much money on marketing.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"ebtdm\",\"text\":\"but enough yapping, let's break down their entire system right now:\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":3,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"862vr\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"54cq6\",\"text\":\"so now that you've seen the system actually works, let me break down exactly how to build it yourself.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"36cjv\",\"text\":\"Step 1: Set up the MCP\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1chu8\",\"text\":\"With RCATS, it generates videos.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"3a0fu\",\"text\":\"Here's how you set up the MCP so Claude can run it for you.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"8orl5\",\"text\":\"the MCP is just what lets Claude actually use RCATS for you. instead of you sitting there clicking through a dashboard, Claude talks to it directly and does the work.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"9ssbp\",\"text\":\"you set it up once and you don't really have to touch it again.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"bbuk8\",\"text\":\"Step 2: Talk to Claude\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"aph74\",\"text\":\"once the MCP is connected, you don't prompt a video tool anymore.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"79h7c\",\"text\":\"you just talk to Claude like you would a creative director.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":4,\"length\":6,\"offset\":36}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"89egi\",\"text\":\"you tell him what you want, he runs Arcads, and the videos comes back.\\nbut before he can make anything, you need to give him a character to work with.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"99kt5\",\"text\":\"Step 3: Create your character\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1lvr2\",\"text\":\"this is the part most people skip, \\nand its exactly why their videos end up looking fake.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5pc36\",\"text\":\"before you make any video you first need a reference \\nfor who your character actually is.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"84td6\",\"text\":\"so you describe them to Claude, and you have to be insanely specific:\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":5,\"length\":6,\"offset\":334},{\"key\":6,\"length\":6,\"offset\":386}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"e6q64\",\"text\":\"→ Age, ethnicity, hair color, skin tone\\n→ Lighting ( natural, gym lighting, golden hour )\\n→ Environment ( gym, kitchen, outdoor, bedroom )\\n→ Accessories ( water bottle, resistance band, airpods )\\n→ Vibe ( serious athlete, wellness girlie, biohacker, morning routine guy )\\n\\nthe best way is to start from a real human \\nand send that to arcads then change it up with nano banana inside of arcads.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"291c3\",\"text\":\"the before is the problem and the after is the result. \\n\\nthat contrast is basically the whole hook, people stop \\nscrolling for the transformation\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"ak2db\",\"text\":\"generate a few and keep the 2-3 that look the most real.\\nexample of before and after below\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":7,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"u6iu\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"c4h57\",\"text\":\"now you have a character thats real enough to build a whole account around.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5aic3\",\"text\":\"Step 4: Make them move\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"bk3rv\",\"text\":\"a static image is only where you start.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":8,\"length\":6,\"offset\":498}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"8bg6p\",\"text\":\"now you need actual moving footage, and this is where most people overcomplicate it.\\n\\n they spend hours trying to prompt realistic motion, sending the longest prompts trying to get the girl to pose and it just looks un-natural\\n\\nthere's a much easier way.\\nDownload a video from pinterest of someone posing \\n\\nsend that video to Gemini and tell it to analyze every body movement\\nAsk it to give you a prompt to replicate those exact movements\\n\\nthen send the prompt to Claude + the start image \\nand the arcads mcp will take care of the rest.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"eo699\",\"text\":\"Super simple.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"auuan\",\"text\":\"Step 5: Edit and add your CTA\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"datp3\",\"text\":\"Once you have both the before and after videos \\nyou can have claude literally stitch them together\\n\\nWhat I personally did is I vibe coded myself a web editor \\nThat Claude can use and that way i can see how it works\\n\\nThat way I see what he is working on \\nThen make sure to add a call to action to your videos in the caption\\n\\nor in the comments \\nsimilar to how the 75 her app does it\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":9,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"24sfa\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"length\":47,\"offset\":0,\"style\":\"Bold\"}],\"key\":\"di8im\",\"text\":\"Step 6: Automate the whole pipeline with Claude\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"97bpo\",\"text\":\"at this point you have a system thats repeatable, \\nso now let's make the whole thing run without you.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"length\":63,\"offset\":429,\"style\":\"Bold\"}],\"key\":\"64s1o\",\"text\":\"since the MCP is connected,\\nClaude doesn't just make one video, he runs the entire pipeline.\\n\\nhe can now \\n→ Make the before and after videos\\n→ Put them together\\n→ And edit elements on top\\n\\nSo all you have to do is post those videos and wait to go viral, \\nMost of the virality will actually come from your characters\\n\\nAnd the before and after format you chose to replicate\\nbecause there are multiple, just follow whats trending.\\n\\nand to actually distribute the content you can do 1 of 2 things\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"length\":25,\"offset\":0,\"style\":\"Bold\"}],\"key\":\"1icuv\",\"text\":\"1 You can do it manually by creating a few accounts on your phone. You can do up to five per phone and then buy a few phones and constantly be posting yourself.\",\"type\":\"ordered-list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"length\":24,\"offset\":0,\"style\":\"Bold\"}],\"key\":\"98h0d\",\"text\":\"2 you can do what we do, \\n\\nwhich is pay somebody $50 a week per account to post.\\n\\nBasically, for $200 a month, we have them post 60 videos across Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube. \\n\\nIt saves us a lot of time because, at scale, this can get pretty tedious, but that is what we do. \\n\\nWe don't use any posting service except for YouTube because that can get you shadow banned pretty quickly\",\"type\":\"ordered-list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"evdkf\",\"text\":\"Step 7: Print views and scale your app\",\"type\":\"header-two\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[{\"key\":10,\"length\":1,\"offset\":0}],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"v13b\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"2cpmh\",\"text\":\"once your AI influencers start performing, if your CTA is good, you'll start seeing spikes in downloads and sales for your app.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5ud59\",\"text\":\"at that point you take the influencer videos that already worked in organic, and you put them behind paid ads.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"5ude7\",\"text\":\"and thats how $200k/mo apps are born.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"d14mn\",\"text\":\"except now you have full control over the content, \\nand you don't need to micro manage any influencers.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"1daf7\",\"text\":\"you are the influencer now, the orchestrator.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"},{\"data\":{},\"entityRanges\":[],\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"key\":\"56cli\",\"text\":\"if you found this guide useful feel free to doomscroll my account, I share sauce on how to make money with apps every day.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\"}],\"entityMap\":[{\"key\":\"8\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"url\":\"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"},\"mutability\":\"Mutable\",\"type\":\"LINK\"}},{\"key\":\"4\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"url\":\"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"},\"mutability\":\"Mutable\",\"type\":\"LINK\"}},{\"key\":\"9\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"6b59bfb6-98d3-44dc-b7ec-dc8bce65a232\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"7\",\"mediaCategory\":\"DraftTweetImage\",\"mediaId\":\"2067990137368137728\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"5\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"url\":\"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"},\"mutability\":\"Mutable\",\"type\":\"LINK\"}},{\"key\":\"10\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"9329be4b-2ca5-4025-9271-00e5953b7be6\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"9\",\"mediaCategory\":\"DraftTweetImage\",\"mediaId\":\"2067990183018942464\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"6\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"url\":\"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"},\"mutability\":\"Mutable\",\"type\":\"LINK\"}},{\"key\":\"1\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"a6058e30-a744-42e0-85ab-b352b17b68d2\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"11\",\"mediaCategory\":\"AmplifyVideo\",\"mediaId\":\"2067990291043188737\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"0\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"url\":\"http://www.arcads.ai/?comet_custom=ernestoSOFTWARE\"},\"mutability\":\"Mutable\",\"type\":\"LINK\"}},{\"key\":\"2\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"5998ae66-e36a-4275-9f13-2340547fc84e\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"1\",\"mediaCategory\":\"DraftTweetImage\",\"mediaId\":\"2067989721943343104\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"7\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"b1a17e7b-53a5-4253-9985-56617f21da83\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"5\",\"mediaCategory\":\"DraftTweetImage\",\"mediaId\":\"2067990088840044544\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}},{\"key\":\"3\",\"value\":{\"data\":{\"entityKey\":\"131d9bd6-d3d2-4bdf-a38a-848ed77af0fd\",\"mediaItems\":[{\"localMediaId\":\"3\",\"mediaCategory\":\"DraftTweetImage\",\"mediaId\":\"2067989778637750272\"}]},\"mutability\":\"Immutable\",\"type\":\"MEDIA\"}}]},\"cover_media\":{\"id\":\"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHLL/epbWUAAKAAIaPAJ0zVcAAAAA\",\"media_id\":\"2067996080898199552\",\"media_info\":{\"__typename\":\"ApiImage\",\"color_info\":{\"palette\":[{\"percentage\":65.64,\"rgb\":{\"blue\":4,\"green\":4,\"red\":7}},{\"percentage\":10.91,\"rgb\":{\"blue\":85,\"green\":103,\"red\":131}},{\"percentage\":8.07,\"rgb\":{\"blue\":179,\"green\":175,\"red\":173}},{\"percentage\":4.7,\"rgb\":{\"blue\":53,\"green\":33,\"red\":19}},{\