 our $300,000/yr app. \"},\"author\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930138018951643136/wEgZY178_200x200.jpg\",\"banner_url\":\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1890388644273258496/1742417398\",\"description\":\"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\",\"followers\":58728,\"following\":794,\"id\":\"1890388644273258496\",\"joined\":\"Fri Feb 14 13:12:38 +0000 2025\",\"likes\":13792,\"location\":\"\",\"media_count\":1917,\"name\":\"Ernesto Lopez\",\"protected\":false,\"raw_description\":{\"facets\":[],\"text\":\"I own a few apps. currently at $200k MRR, sharing daily B2C scaling strategies. founder of @tryviewtrack\"},\"screen_name\":\"ErnestoSOFTWARE\",\"statuses\":7090,\"type\":\"profile\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE\",\"verification\":{\"type\":\"individual\",\"verified\":true,\"verified_at\":null},\"website\":null},\"bookmarks\":6597,\"community_note\":null,\"created_at\":\"Tue Mar 17 14:45:46 +0000 2026\",\"created_timestamp\":1773758746,\"embed_card\":\"tweet\",\"id\":\"2033917717762191659\",\"is_note_tweet\":false,\"lang\":null,\"likes\":1701,\"media\":{},\"possibly_sensitive\":false,\"provider\":\"twitter\",\"quotes\":52,\"raw_text\":{\"display_text_range\":[0,23],\"facets\":[],\"text\":\"https://t.co/DJ9Ljrt0y5\"},\"replies\":43,\"replying_to\":null,\"reposted_by\":null,\"reposts\":116,\"source\":\"Twitter Web App\",\"text\":\"\",\"type\":\"status\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/ErnestoSOFTWARE/status/2033917717762191659\",\"views\":1316685},{\"article\":{\"content\":{\"blocks\":[],\"entityMap\":[]},\"cover_media\":{\"id\":\"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHCf3V3yWkAAKAAIaPAJ0zVcAAAAA\",\"media_id\":\"2028862112278155264\",\"media_info\":{\"__typename\":\"ApiImage\",\"color_info\":{\"palette\":[{\"percentage\":43.49,\"rgb\":{\"blue\":41,\"green\":51,\"red\":60}},{\"percentage\":28.95,\"rgb\":{\"blue\":104,\"green\":117,\"red\":131}},{\"percentage\":19.94,\"rgb\":{\"blue\"