{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'for f in /Users/anicca/anicca/skills/earn/marketing-engine/evidence/intel/pulls/68f5220fe826411ab0d41408bda1f09e/apple.*.json; do print \"FILE:$f\"; jq -r '\"'.result.payload.results[] | {trackId, version, trackName, sellerName, averageUserRating, userRatingCount, url, artworkUrl100, description, releaseNotes, screenshotUrls, genres, primaryGenreName, price, formattedPrice} | @json' \\\"\"'$f\"; done'","aggregated_output":"FILE:/Users/anicca/anicca/skills/earn/marketing-engine/evidence/intel/pulls/68f5220fe826411ab0d41408bda1f09e/apple.competitors-affirmation-us.json\n{\"trackId\":874656917,\"version\":\"6.47.0\",\"trackName\":\"I am - Daily Affirmations\",\"sellerName\":\"Monkey Taps\",\"averageUserRating\":4.83804,\"userRatingCount\":724857,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/e2/db/ca/e2dbca45-f5a9-9232-dd7a-98a32df3d1b9/0_iam-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-0-0-1-0-0-sRGB-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"How many negative thoughts have been endlessly repeating in your mind? Daily affirmations help rewire our brains, build self-esteem, and change negative thought patterns. Empower yourself by verbally affirming your dreams and ambitions. Choose from many daily intentions and set reminders to be delivered throughout the day.\\n\\nPositive affirmations help make major shifts in your mindset, and they also serve as prompts and daily reminders about what you’re truly capable of, ensuring every day is an amazing day\\n\\nAn affirmation is a simple but powerful statement that helps to strengthen the connection between your conscious and unconscious mind. The more you strengthen this connection, the more resilient you’ll be when you experience difficult or challenging circumstances.\\n\\nAs Buddha wisely said: you become what you believe. And the best way to strengthen your resilience is to practice affirmations every single day.\\n\\n\\nThere are many benefits to using affirmations as part of your daily morning routine:\\n\\n\\n- They help increase your awareness of your thoughts and words, making it easier to recognize the negative and self-doubting thought patterns holding you back.\\n- Affirmations define your focus. When you focus your energy on the things you want, like achieving your goals, the positive, uplifting, and good, you’re creating an abundance mindset and strengthening your resolve to make it happen.\\n- They open you up to possibility. Too often we get stuck in the ‘impossible’ mindset, but affirmations flip this on its head. When you begin to positively affirm what is actually possible, a whole world of opportunity opens up to you.\\n\\nTo get access to the I am Premium content and functionality, you can choose between a lifetime, monthly, and yearly auto-renewable subscription. This is a recurring transaction that will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew unless you cancel it at least 24 hours before the end of your subscription. Renewals will be charged at the same cost within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. You can manage your subscriptions and auto-renewal can be turned off by going to your iTunes Account Settings after purchase.\\n\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.theiam.app/\\n\\nPrivacy Policy: https://monkeytaps.net/privacy\\n\\nTerms of use: https://monkeytaps.net/terms\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- New themes and tons of new affirmations!\\n- Other fixes and improvements\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.theiam.app/\\n\\nLove the app? Tell us in the reviews section! We read all of them. Have a happy day!\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"Health & Fitness\",\"Lifestyle\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\n{\"trackId\":876080126,\"version\":\"6.46.0\",\"trackName\":\"Motivation - Daily quotes\",\"sellerName\":\"Monkey Taps\",\"averageUserRating\":4.82826,\"userRatingCount\":1063045,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/e7/c4/a6/e7c4a62b-54f8-f9f3-0b0c-2eb885d01f35/0_motivation-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-0-0-1-0-0-P3-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"Whether you're going through hard times, need an extra push to get stuff done, or like sharing inspirational quotes on social media, Motivation has you covered.\\n\\nPositive reminders are one of the simplest and most powerful tools for mental growth. It’s all about keeping the right thoughts top of mind from the get-go every day, so they’re readily available on those hard days when you need them most.\\n\\nNow, from iOS 14, you can think positive thoughts without even trying with the Motivation widget! Simply install the widget in your home screen and customize it from the app. You can have as many widgets as you want!\\n\\nCustomize the design of the quotes and share the uplifting message of the day with your friends, or use the image for Instagram or as a wallpaper.\\n\\nThe app includes a wide range of topics such as self-esteem, relationships, and dealing with stress, as well as a selection of carefully designed themes to choose from - updated frequently.\\n\\n+ Read through Hundreds of Quotes\\n+ Find Motivational Books\\n+ Save or Share your Quotes\\n+ Set Motivational Reminders throughout the Day\\n+ Save your Favorite Quotes\\n+ Change Font and Colors\\n+ Filter Quotes by Category\\n+ Set a Home Screen Motivation Widget\\n\\nFrom quotes about working out to love and family quotes, Motivation has them all! Browse thousands of quotes organized by category:\\n\\n\\n- Motivation to work harder\\n- Love quotes\\n- Motivation to train and work out\\n- Help for depression\\n- Boost your self-esteem and self-confidence\\n- Get over a break up\\n- Life lessons and sayings\\n- Sports quotes from athletes and trainers\\n- Business, money, success, and career\\n- Being present and mindful\\n- Quotes from and for women\\n- Philosophy from the best minds\\n- Quotes to be thankful for what you got\\n- Inspirations for joy\\n- Quotes from movies\\n- Verses from the Bible\\n- And much more!\\n\\nAnd now with Motivation Premium you can:\\n\\n\\n+ Remove ads\\n+ Unlock all themes and categories\\n+ Set background photo\\n+ Get unlimited reminders\\n+ Search quotes\\n\\nTo get access to the Motivation Premium content and functionality, you can choose between a lifetime, monthly, and yearly auto-renewable subscription. This is a recurring transaction that will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew unless you cancel it at least 24 hours before the end of your subscription. Renewals will be charged at the same cost within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. You can manage your subscriptions and auto-renewal can be turned off by going to your iTunes Account Settings after purchase.\\n\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.motivation.app/\\n\\nPrivacy Policy: https://monkeytaps.net/privacy\\n\\nTerms of use: https://monkeytaps.net/terms\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- New themes and tons of new quotes!\\n- Other fixes and improvements\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.motivation.app/\\n\\nLove the app? Tell us in the reviews section! We read all of them. Have a happy day!\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"Health & Fitness\",\"Lifestyle\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\n{\"trackId\":1202851636,\"version\":\"5.9.5\",\"trackName\":\"Mantra - Daily Affirmations\",\"sellerName\":\"Broftware House Yazilim Tasarim Anonim Sirketi\",\"averageUserRating\":4.8381,\"userRatingCount\":33984,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/24/11/fe/2411fee2-656b-9387-4d2c-6a88ce9f311f/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-0-sRGB-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"Our brains are wired to repeat negative feelings if fed with negative thoughts. Luckily the same goes for the positive side. Daily affirmations help us rewire our brains and fix these negative patterns. \\n\\n“If you practice saying positive things in non-stressful situations, it has been found that you can change your brain’s reactions” - Caroline Miller \\n\\nAffirmations are simple yet powerful statements that help us validate our core values. The latest researches indicate that practicing positive mantras and daily affirmations decreases stress, improves performance on challenging duties, builds self-esteem, and overall, makes us happier. As a result; we feel better, make healthier decisions, and live a happier life. Now, unleash your subconscious mind’s power and take your first step in the world of affirmations with Mantra.\\n\\nAll the affirmations inside our app are constantly updated. Instructions are clear: Think positive and hold down the button! Your affirmation will glow and you will light up! Give it a try and observe how you start your days in a better mood! Besides your daily affirmations, you can always read as many affirmations as you like by simply swiping.\\n\\nHere is what you will get with our application:\\n• Affirmations for any situation from 30+ different categories and topics.\\n• More than a thousand \\\"I am\\\" affirmations\\n• Smart daytime and bedtime affirmation reminders (as push notifications)\\n• Uniquely new daily affirmations\\n• Practice as many affirmations as you want\\n• Create your own collections of affirmations \\n• Add your own affirmations if you can’t find what you’re looking for\\n• Record your voice and listen on repeat\\n• Manifestation sessions and guided affirmation sessions\\n• Personalize your theme with hundreds of cherry-picked background images, videos and fonts\\n• Ambient sounds that uplift you\\n• Share your daily affirmations to any platform in portrait or square mode\\n• Like your affirmations to see them anytime in your favorites\\n• And much, much more…\\n\\nIf you have any feedback please contact us via email: mantra@broftware.com  We will get back to you immediately :)   Love you!\\n\\n--\\n\\nPrivate Policy:\\nhttps://getmantra.app/privacy-policy\\n\\nTerms of Use:\\nhttps://getmantra.app/terms\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Keep nurturing your positive mindset with Mantra! \\n\\nIn this update, we’ve added many new affirmations and made some improvements to enhance your experience.\\n\\nIf you're enjoying the app, consider leaving a review for other people! Your reviews mean the world to us, and we read every single one.\\n\\nIf you encounter any issues, please email us at mantra@broftware.com. Your feedback is essential in helping us improve!\\n\\nThank you for making Mantra a part of your day.\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/ee/5c/16/ee5c1642-4ec7-95d4-4246-0e0f16164adc/0fa16dde-1bf7-4749-aa12-6056f7571ea6_En1.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/c3/2f/32/c32f32cc-3a74-c882-de32-54dda0c2a358/d71c48a1-4e57-49bb-b03a-eb6bbc60df30_En2.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/6c/6e/cc/6c6ecc19-ee27-ce70-8a1b-1e17df6d93de/bbb4c5c5-4c53-4988-87cb-93c12d8085ec_En3.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/20/2d/d8/202dd840-8671-e6cb-ec78-06e8f4eddc9d/894db419-e166-4a30-a5d7-806441c4dd5a_En4.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/80/a0/79/80a07931-10b5-564d-7337-b59f4a0223ec/a1ba3558-04fd-4ace-915c-b336e95842e9_En5.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/8c/77/0b/8c770b7f-3f73-70f4-1850-f2238632bcdc/6d0c6f46-f0c5-4e16-9faa-59dac63fbf82_En6.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/5b/2a/61/5b2a617e-8646-f6c2-7471-84530ed8eb72/cd803fdb-a62c-4ea7-a443-2b48c981eacf_En7.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/a2/9e/18/a29e189c-197a-80a9-e53e-97fb2b29ad0a/48ad1c32-b621-4886-a611-d59a4d225ba6_En8.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/be/2b/a6/be2ba6d4-726a-6006-33e9-45e743975725/6e2dbf54-bc47-4dd2-8bb1-83f2f8e099e8_En9.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/3a/19/bb/3a19bbb1-c947-4e5d-1df4-b1d64bc0ff40/2b5ebed7-81a6-4ca3-94ad-4333d5f23643_En10.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\"],\"genres\":[\"Health & Fitness\",\"Lifestyle\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\n{\"trackId\":1585586331,\"version\":\"3.3.5\",\"trackName\":\"Affirmations for You\",\"sellerName\":\"Appcano LLC\",\"averageUserRating\":4.78521,\"userRatingCount\":2989,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/d5/4e/9c/d54e9ccd-c2ae-a383-3f38-8eb7e18c1912/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"Unlock the Power of Affirmations with Our App!\\n\\nTransform your life one positive thought at a time. The Affirmations App helps you harness your inner strength, align with your desires, and create the life you’ve always dreamed of. Whether you’re looking to attract MONEY, improve your SLEEP, or foster a deeper SPIRITUAL connection, this app is your ultimate guide to manifesting positivity and success.\\n\\nWhy Use Affirmations?\\nAffirmations are more than just words—they are powerful declarations of what you want to create in life. By practicing daily affirmations, you can reprogram your mind, overcome negativity, and achieve your goals. Whether you’re seeking financial abundance, a BIBLICAL perspective, or a more POSITIVE mindset, affirmations offer a proven way to transform your thoughts into actions.\\n\\nHow It Works:\\n- Discover Daily Affirmations: Choose from expertly curated categories like success, relationships, gratitude, and JOURNAL prompts for deeper reflection.\\n- Create Your Own: Be your own affirmation CREATOR and design personalized affirmations tailored to your unique journey.\\n- Build a Daily Routine: Use customizable tools like affirmation WIDGETS and a calming ALARM to keep your practice consistent.\\n- Features of the Affirmations App:\\n- A vast library of affirmations designed for success, money, and personal growth\\n- Custom JOURNAL for tracking affirmations and personal insights\\n- Beautiful WIDGET designs to keep affirmations visible throughout your day\\n- Calming ALARM tones to start and end your day with positivity\\n- Tools for crafting personalized affirmations as your own affirmation MAKER\\n\\nWhy Affirmations Work:\\nYour thoughts shape your reality. By focusing on POSITIVE affirmations daily, you can foster self-love, embrace abundance, and align your actions with your goals. Whether you’re connecting with BIBLICAL principles, improving SLEEP, or achieving financial success, affirmations are the key to living with purpose. This app helps you cultivate a mindset that supports both your SPIRITUAL and personal growth.\\n\\nLive Your Best Life: \\nThe Affirmations App is your gateway to mindfulness and intentional living. Whether you’re looking to attract MONEY, build confidence, or deepen your SPIRITUAL awareness, this app supports your growth every step of the way. Make affirmations a part of your daily routine, and watch as positivity transforms your life into the one you’ve always envisioned.\\n\\nDownload the Affirmations App today and become the CREATOR of your best self!\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Brand new redesigned experience\\n- New iOS glass design for a modern look\\n- Improved widgets for your home screen\\n- Apple Watch experience upgraded\\n- Faster performance across the app\\n- Bug fixes and stability improvements\\n\\nThank you to everyone for all the great support! We are working very hard to get stuff done. In this update you'll find bug fixes, small improvements and performance enhancements. If you love Affirmations App, please rate us, it would really help! :)\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"Health & Fitness\",\"Productivity\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\n{\"trackId\":1372575227,\"version\":\"5.7.6\",\"trackName\":\"Gratitude: Self-Care Journal\",\"sellerName\":\"Hapjoy Technologies Private Limited\",\"averageUserRating\":4.88145,\"userRatingCount\":44897,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/f1/f4/fb/f1f4fba6-41c3-6c6c-16bc-5c8dbb0f9c36/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"The Gratitude app is a carefully-designed self-care tool to help you focus on your mental health.\\n\\nWith a gratitude journal, affirmations, vision board, and daily motivation content, Gratitude provides you with all the tools and reminders you need to gain motivation and develop a healthy self-love routine in your life. \\n \\nTo live a happy and fulfilling life, it is important for us to have good mental health and a strong sense of self-love.\\n\\nAnd, as the app is completely private, you can always be assured that your precious journal entries, affirmations, and vision board are for your eyes only.\\n\\nHere are the tools that you will find in the Gratitude app:\\n\\n1. GRATITUDE JOURNAL\\n\\nA gratitude journal or diary opens up your eyes to reflect on all the little blessings in your life.\\n\\nIn daily life, we can lose sight of what we are fortunate to have and by keeping a journal you can slowly and steadily shift your perspective to focus on what is good in your life.\\n\\nThe Gratitude app will send you reminders with prompts to help you build the habit of journaling.\\n\\nYou can also add photos to your journal entries and can record journals in your voice, build a gratitude journal streak, and access hundreds of journal prompts. \\n\\n2. POSITIVE AFFIRMATIONS\\n\\nIf you’ve heard about manifestation or the law of attraction, you’ve probably heard about affirmations.\\n\\nPositive daily affirmations change our self-talk to focus on more loving and kind thoughts towards ourselves.\\n\\nThey give us the motivation we need to keep moving forward and believe in ourselves.\\n\\nThe Gratitude app has hundreds of affirmations that you can listen to or read, as per your need.\\n\\nYou can also write your own affirmations, add music, and record your voice to them.\\n\\nPositive affirmations are a dearly loved tool and with this affirmations app, it is very easy for you to practice them.\\n\\n3. CREATE VISION BOARDS\\n\\nAnother super popular manifestation tool is a vision board, also called a dream board. The vision board serves as a collage of your dreams and goals in the form of photos, quotes, and affirmations.\\n\\nIn the Gratitude app, we’ll help you make a great vision board using sections, goal ideas, and create a video of all your goals together with music. You can also make multiple vision boards!\\n\\n4. DAILY ZEN\\n\\nWe understand the need for motivation and inspiration as you build a healthy routine with these self-help tools, which is why Daily Zen is an important part of the app.\\n\\nHere, you will find gratitude quotes, motivation quotes, thought switch ideas, thank you cards, affirmations, blog articles, and real-life stories of people who changed their mindset with gratitude.\\n\\n5. MINDFUL MINUTES\\n\\nWe define the Mindful minutes as the time that you spend in the Gratitude app. You can view the mindful minutes under 'All Health Data' section in the Health app provided by Apple. Currently, the app does not read any data from the health app. We don't write any data in the health app without your consent. You can turn on the mindful minutes from the profile & settings in the Gratitude app.\\n\\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.notion.so/Gratitude-App-Privacy-Policy-40195d1e9f51499c82dc8f7d06ab2a1c\\nTerms of Use: https://medium.com/@priteshsankhe/terms-and-conditions-c7a676f5d884\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Thank you for being part of the Gratitude community!\\nIn this update, we’ve focused on helping you stay consistent and improving overall stability:\\n\\n- Addressed an issue where Daily Zen posts could not be shared on Instagram\\n\\nLoving the app? Please consider leaving us a review - it helps more people discover Gratitude.\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"Health & Fitness\",\"Lifestyle\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\n{\"trackId\":1591901241,\"version\":\"6.2\",\"trackName\":\"Self Love - Daily Affirmations\",\"sellerName\":\"Ravi Kotadiya\",\"averageUserRating\":4.77431,\"userRatingCount\":1985,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/aa/8b/c4/aa8bc479-245a-36d7-0f0b-bf25809e4553/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-0-sRGB-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"Stuck in negative thought loops? Self Love delivers daily affirmations, powerful I am statements, and gentle reminders exactly when you need them—so positivity is never out of reach.\\n\\nTransform your mindset with uplifting quotes on your lock screen, beautiful home-screen widgets, and themed backgrounds that make every affirmation feel personal. \\n\\nRead it. Speak it. Believe it.\\n\\nWHY SELF LOVE WORKS?\\n\\nDaily affirmations are more than quotes—they are small habits that reshape how you see yourself. With Self Love, you replace self-doubt with confidence, calm, and clarity one message at a time.\\n\\nDAILY AFFIRMATIONS & I AM STATEMENTS\\n\\n• Hundreds of affirmations for confidence, self-esteem, gratitude, and growth\\n• I am statements that strengthen a positive mindset\\n• New categories and quotes added regularly\\n• Save favorites and revisit the messages that resonate most\\n\\nREMINDERS THAT MEET YOU WHERE YOU ARE\\n\\n• Smart reminders deliver affirmations throughout your day\\n• Choose how often you want encouragement—morning, midday, or evening\\n• Turn your phone into a source of support, not stress\\n\\nWIDGETS & BEAUTIFUL THEMES\\n\\n• Home-screen widgets keep affirmations visible all day\\n• Stunning themes and backgrounds personalize your self-care routine\\n• A calm, uplifting design made for daily use\\n\\nEXPLORE CATEGORIES FOR EVERY MOOD\\n\\n• Confidence & self-belief\\n• Mental wellness & self-care\\n• Manifestation & abundance\\n• Stoic calm & mindfulness\\n• Seasonal inspiration (New Year, holidays, and more)\\n\\nMIRROR MODE & DAILY PRACTICES\\n\\n• Speak affirmations to yourself in Mirror Mode — a therapist-recommended technique\\n• Build your streak and stay consistent day after day\\n• Quick Story Style practices for deeper self-reflection\\n\\nBUILT FOR YOUR WHOLE DAY\\n\\n• iPhone & iPad\\n• Apple Watch affirmations on your wrist\\n• iMessage support\\n\\nSPEAK IT. BELIEVE IT. LIVE IT.\\n\\nMany users read each affirmation twice and speak it aloud twice—so the words sink in and become part of how you think. Small repetition. Real change.\\n\\nFREE TO START. PREMIUM WHEN YOU’RE READY\\n\\nDownload free and explore daily affirmations at your own pace. Upgrade to Premium to unlock the full library, themes, widgets, and reminders.\\n\\nSELF LOVE PREMIUM\\n\\n• Monthly and annual plans available\\n• Optional free trial on eligible subscriptions\\n• Payment charged to your Apple ID account\\n• Subscription renews automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period\\n• Manage or cancel anytime in App Store account settings\\n\\nPrivacy Policy: http://ruruinfotech.com/PrivacyPolicy/im/imp.html\\nTerms of Use: http://ruruinfotech.com/PrivacyPolicy/im/imtou.html\\n\\nYour journey to self-love starts with one affirmation today. Download Self Love and feel the difference.\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Make every glance more uplifting with Affirmation Wallpapers!\\n\\n• Create personalized wallpapers with your favorite themes and affirmation categories.\\n• Automatically change your wallpaper using Apple Shortcuts.\\n• Discover hundreds of new affirmations across more self-growth categories.\\n• Enjoy beautiful new themes and additional customization options.\\n• Performance improvements, bug fixes, and overall app enhancements.\\n\\nEnjoying Self Love? Please leave a review on the App Store. We read every review and truly appreciate your support.\\n\\nThank you for growing with us.\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"Health & Fitness\",\"Lifestyle\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\n{\"trackId\":1671846678,\"version\":\"2.004\",\"trackName\":\"Daily Affirmations & Widgets\",\"sellerName\":\"Alexey Reshetnikov\",\"averageUserRating\":4.80975,\"userRatingCount\":841,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/32/e0/9c/32e09c35-0918-3c49-8f3b-637bd7f0bec7/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"Daily affirmations app Miracle is one of the best affirmations apps for iPhone with widgets. Build motivation, shift your mindset, and bring more positivity into your day.\\n\\nUse daily affirmations and motivational quotes to push through challenges and stay focused on what you want. Miracle is an affirmations app for women built around daily affirmations for positivity and self-belief, designed to actually fit into your routine instead of just sitting on your home screen.\\n\\nKey Features:\\n• Daily Affirmations\\nStart each day with an affirmation matched to your goals. Whether you want daily affirmations for women, morning affirmations, or powerful daily affirmations, Miracle gives you words that support self-belief and a positive mindset from the moment you wake up.\\n\\n• Affirmation Practice, Your Voice and Your Pace\\nRun guided affirmation sessions the way you want. Choose the voice that reads your affirmations out loud, and set how long each step of the practice lasts. Slow and grounding before bed, or quick and focused before a meeting. Both work.\\n\\n• Adaptive Widgets\\nAdd adaptive widgets to your Home Screen. They adjust to your wallpaper and time of day, surfacing a fresh affirmation whenever you glance at your phone.\\n\\n• Lock Screen Widgets\\nSet an affirmation as your lock screen so a positive thought greets you every time you pick up your phone.\\n\\n• Ambient Sounds\\nAdd rain, sea, birds, night, and other ambient sounds. Use them during practice, or just as background while you read your affirmations.\\n\\n• Custom Fonts\\nChange the font your affirmations are written in. Find one that feels right to read.\\n\\n• Custom Backgrounds\\nPick a background from different categories to make the app look the way you want it to.\\n\\n• iOS 26 Alarms Integration\\nWake up to your affirmations. Miracle plugs into iOS 26 Alarms, so your morning practice begins the moment your alarm goes off, not as one more notification fighting for attention.\\n\\n• Customizable Reminders\\nSchedule reminders for the times that work for you. Morning affirmations to start the day, positive affirmations any time you need a reset. Our daily affirmations for women app keeps you consistent.\\n\\n• Positive Daily Affirmations Library\\nBrowse a full library of affirmations, sorted by category: positive affirmations for women, powerful daily affirmations, manifest affirmations, and more. Find the right words for the moment.\\n\\n• Save and Favorite\\nSave the affirmations that resonate to your personal collection in our free affirmations app. Build a library of daily affirmations for women, positive affirmation quotes, and favorites you come back to. You can also write your own.\\n\\n• Share the Positivity\\nSend your favorite affirmations to friends and family through social media, text, or email.\\n\\n• Clean, Simple Interface\\nEasy to navigate, easy to use. Open the app, get what you came for, move on with your day.\\n\\nLooking for the best affirmation app? Download Miracle now and start building the mindset you want.\\n\\nTerms of use: https://reshetnikoff.com/terms/\\nPrivacy policy: https://reshetnikoff.com/policy/\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Practice reminder bug fix\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/34/12/0b/34120b9c-4b96-ca8f-2624-a7d2808d37ed/2441a9a3-afac-4771-913a-f67bd1eb88bd_1._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/e5/fe/61/e5fe61c4-5ba0-978f-5846-043a3fddea70/79ae195c-3d8e-462a-9af6-a7a0acc7bf9e_2._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/31/b9/45/31b94520-db97-6ae3-5750-634af9dca9a5/ee2d4afb-6f2b-4f3f-8e44-b5884a31d24a_3._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/30/36/da/3036dac1-59b2-84bb-48f3-18722bd94c78/c798679f-4a9f-4d56-b5fe-133d846a20c1_4._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/bf/b9/e2/bfb9e2e7-aec5-8338-56a8-457459d63d54/ac6a53d2-7639-4dd2-b754-75a6be4229e8_5._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/75/5e/03/755e0390-f746-67f9-d3de-263d582a2c4a/e4fa8530-5e85-4b89-be4b-d14fbc3d599f_6._1242_U04452208.jpg/392x696bb.jpg\"],\"genres\":[\"Lifestyle\",\"Health & Fitness\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Lifestyle\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\n{\"trackId\":586028606,\"version\":\"17.5.0\",\"trackName\":\"Daily Quote - Positive quotes\",\"sellerName\":\"Ultabit, LLC\",\"averageUserRating\":4.75122,\"userRatingCount\":66280,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/ee/43/d4/ee43d401-ab4c-c9b7-c98c-77bc3b2f2a06/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-10-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"Inspirational and motivational quotes. Daily reminders to help you overcome adversity, persevere, achieve your goals, succeed. Start your day with a quote from our thoughtfully curated collection.\\n\\nDAILY QUOTE WALLPAPERS\\nMeaningful photography and typography, hand-picked, and carefully combined to make quotes more impactful.\\n\\nIMPORTANT: iPhone wallpapers are optimized for iPhone XS, iPhone XS Max, iPhone XR, iPhone X, iPhone 8 & iPhone 8 Plus, iPhone 7 & 7 Plus, iPhone 6s & 6s Plus!\\n\\nAUDIO QUOTES \\nHave quotes read aloud by Siri! From your lock screen! Get a “pick me up” whenever you need it with Audio Quotes.\\n\\nUse a phrase, such as “Motivate me”, “Inspire me”, “Activate positivity”. Choose from different categories:\\n\\n• The Quote of the Day\\n• Our Most Popular Quotes\\n• Inspirational Quotes\\n• Motivational Quotes\\n• Positive Mindset Quotes\\n• Success Quotes\\n\\nAudio Quotes require an in-app purchase. See below for more details.\\n\\nSIRI SHORTCUTS\\nIn addition to Audio Quotes, you can personalize and add Siri Shortcuts for most essential features.\\n\\nWhy should you download the Daily Quote app?\\n\\n• Downloaded and enjoyed by MILLIONS of people!\\n• Recognized as one of the \\\"favorite gadgets\\\" of former Girl Scouts CEO Anna Maria Chávez.\\n• Featured in Success Magazine article titled \\\"A New You: Reinvent yourself with these apps\\\"\\n\\nHere are just a couple reviews we're proud of (and truly humbled by):\\n\\nAmazing! by Sam.i.am\\nAmazing is only one word to describe this app. It always has meaningful quotes that really can push yourself to do better! I would definitely encourage people to get this app!\\n\\nWorks well by LolaBarbie\\nI had this app for about 3 years! Works well!\\n\\nDaily Inspiration by 123becky\\nLove seeing my DailyQuote. They put hope for the day and motivate me with a positive attitude in facing each new day. Especially since I am handicapped living in pain every day. So I do look forward to my daily inspiration.\\n\\nIt's simple but helpful! by NickiBYU\\nI've had this app for over a year now and it's been great. No kinks or anything just a simple quote every morning to remind me of important ways to be that help me throughout the day. I love it!\\n\\nFEATURES\\nOur goal is to provide motivational and inspirational quotes each day. \\n\\n• Set reminders to view your daily quote\\n• Save your favorite quotes\\n• Add hashtags to your favorite quotes so you can easily find them later\\n• Add quotes\\n• Set a custom background photo, or choose from our free collection\\n• Browse a mix of quotes from our collection\\n\\nCreate And Share\\n• Create quote wallpapers for uses as backgrounds and lock screen wallpapers\\n• Customize font size, font color, and layout, before saving or sharing \\n• Add emoji or add additional text to quotes\\n• Select from custom background photos and background colors\\n• Easily share quotes on Instagram\\n\\n\\\"Create And Share\\\" requires our companion app, QWP, which is also available as a free download. \\n\\nPREMIUM FEATURES\\n• Audio Quotes\\n• Quote Search\\n• Ad-free usage\\n\\nDaily Quote is free to download and use. We also have premium features that require an in-app purchase. You can choose a single, one-time purchase, for lifetime access. Or you can purchase a yearly, or monthly, auto-renewing subscription. \\n\\nIf you choose to subscribe, your subscription will automatically renew and charge your credit card through your iTunes account. You can turn off auto-renew at any time from your iTunes account settings. Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Any unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited after purchase.\\n\\nDailyQuote privacy policy: http://dailyqotd.com/privacy\\n\\nDailyQuote terms of use: http://dailyqotd.com/user-agreement\\n\\nWe're grateful for your continuous support. If you have any questions or suggestions on how we can improve the app, please do not hesitate to contact us at http://dailyqotd.com/feedback\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Stability improvements and bug fixes. Fixed bug where notification is not sent at set time.\\n\\nThoughts or feedback? Please leave a review here on the App Store or contact me at http://dailyquoteapp.com/feedback\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/f8/b8/85/f8b885a5-2849-b13f-663d-32a064c69718/0f9c8afd-6216-4956-be32-fdf423d0c666_iPhone-5.5-2.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/bf/e3/e2/bfe3e2d0-fd62-a331-5660-f9737113256f/24457efc-ed04-44c2-a3c2-8c4f1094cd28_5.5-recap.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/a4/a2/00/a4a20023-0f51-6e3e-41f2-aefe07c9801e/a40c5bb3-f5dc-40bc-9a65-be8a83ffecc4_5.5-siri-shortcuts.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/db/2b/30/db2b30ac-a6cb-6a86-dcf4-461d9f88a35e/bc61904e-f95d-4763-8329-73e362d44d02_5.5-share.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/a2/bb/fe/a2bbfef6-0bfa-5be1-bd3f-6905779a38a8/b3ad43ef-22cb-4597-bcb5-be099940dfce_5.5-background.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/98/66/13/9866130c-76bf-0c06-43f8-b97722fbdc02/12a96d97-6975-4b23-9292-c18c1418162f_5.5-font.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/7b/33/e7/7b33e719-5b93-7806-8afe-d52b3ad59855/50b0a24b-0a38-444f-8d87-43f7ffe88c0c_5.5-photo-settings.png/392x696bb.png\"],\"genres\":[\"Lifestyle\",\"Reference\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Lifestyle\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\n{\"trackId\":418693319,\"version\":\"6.0.8\",\"trackName\":\"Unique Daily Affirmations\",\"sellerName\":\"Gopher Apps LLC\",\"averageUserRating\":4.76656,\"userRatingCount\":19765,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/cc/1e/ea/cc1eea02-9dd8-cc06-e96d-fdbb9575e3de/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-6-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"Unique Daily Affirmations is a free creative affirmation tool that helps you succeed in your endeavors, bring you out from under the clouds, and make positive changes in your life. Through uplifting statements and quotes, you'll believe in yourself with these one-a-day affirmations for daily motivation.\\n\\nHold down the large gray button to reveal your daily affirmation and effectively use the app by repeating the statement out loud.  Saying the affirmation in front of a mirror is even better. It's been scientifically proven that the more stimuli your mind has, the more your mind will retain the information.  By vocalizing in front of a mirror, you stimulate sight and sound.  Envision your personal success.\\n\\nLet these positive declarations become truth in your subconscious mind as you think about it throughout the day.\\n\\nGive us some feedback in the app if you have suggestions or problems.  We really doubt you'll need this though;  just look at all the raving reviews:\\n\\n\\\"Missing one important thing - I think this app is neat but I believe the real power of daily affirmations is when you repeat the same affirmations day after day. A new one every day kind of loses its power because you should be repeating the ones that are important to you so that they eventually become ingrained and change your way of thinking. So, a favorites list would be the perfect solution! If a daily affirmation pops up that you really want to stay with you, add to your favorites and go to your favorites list and read through them everyday. ...\\\" - Tag477543\\n\\nExcellent affirmations\\nThis app provides excellent affirmations to start your day. Every day a new affirmation is generated in which you can use and apply it to your life. I have been using it for a couple of months and it definitely helps start my day to a positive start. I highly recommend it!!\\n-Oceanblue27\\n\\nFantastic\\nI love this affirmations app, it's really practical, it's not just a bunch of quotes like some affirmations apps I've seen. :) well done!\\n-Ladyredfearn\\n\\nHighly recommend this app. - I love this app. The affirmation statements are great and not convoluted. I love the hold button and the slow revealing of the affirmation. Gives you that moment to slow your mind and focus on the moment and truly take in the affirmation.\\n- Hkygal\\n\\nINSTRUCTIONS\\nPress and hold the large gray button to reveal today's affirmation.\\n\\nTap the bottom left icon for options on sharing, saving or skipping the affirmation.  You can SHARE, SAVE, or VIEW the affirmation.\\n\\nWhen viewing your list of Favorite affirmations you can swipe left to delete an affirmation.  Tapping on a specific affirmation will let you view it.\\n\\nTo add your own affirmations, tap on the bottom left icon then tap on \\\"Add Your Own\\\".  Any affirmation you add will appear in your favorites list.\\n\\nTo record yourself saying an affirmation, tap the top right REC icon and then on the red button to start recording.  You can save one recording per affirmation.\\n\\nTo add your own backgrounds, tap on the bottom right icon,  then tap on \\\"My Backgrounds\\\".  Any background here will appear in one of your daily affirmations unless you set one as your current.\\n\\nALL ACCESS\\nWhen you subscribe to \\\"All Access\\\":\\n - Ads are removed (even if you decide to cancel)\\n - Set up email notifications of your favorites\\n - No limits* on Phone Alerts\\n - No limits on the number of recordings\\n - No limits on the number of backgrounds\\n - Set the daily affirmation as a Phone Alert\\n - Set a background and font for each favorite\\n\\n* Notifications are limited to device limits.\\n\\n“All Access” is a monthly subscription that automatically renews at the same cost as the first month.  Payment is charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.  Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period.  Turn off auto-renew at any time from your iTunes Account settings.\\n\\nTERMS & PRIVACY POLICY\\nhttps://gopherapps.com/terms/\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Improved automatic text color on background photos — light and dark text is now chosen from the area directly behind your quote, so affirmations stay readable on tricky images.\\n• Widget backgrounds now get the same automatic text color treatment.\\n• Fixed favorites and custom quote lists not refreshing after deleting or clearing quotes.\\n• Cleaned up the Unsplash photo picker layout.\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/80/9c/9e/809c9e14-4685-fe52-99a9-f9e7e1968dc1/mzl.vfvfpglt.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/a8/c8/ae/a8c8aec6-bddb-0a11-4187-1f48ae41685a/mzl.usxwnual.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/b3/15/50/b31550a7-4192-273a-3504-9b13e14a3499/mzl.vldefdij.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/80/74/ef/8074ef25-61d9-25ba-4092-06707630d39c/mzl.xlndpkum.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/b6/23/84/b62384a7-24d6-ddf5-651e-80a912fe87d6/mzl.gwdxiism.png/392x696bb.png\"],\"genres\":[\"Lifestyle\",\"Health & Fitness\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Lifestyle\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"Free\"}\nFILE:/Users/anicca/anicca/skills/earn/marketing-engine/evidence/intel/pulls/68f5220fe826411ab0d41408bda1f09e/apple.competitors-relationship-jp.json\n{\"trackId\":1494428618,\"version\":\"2.0.53\",\"trackName\":\"あんさんぶるスターズ！！Music\",\"sellerName\":\"Happy Elements K.K\",\"averageUserRating\":4.43444,\"userRatingCount\":71352,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/5c/de/2d/5cde2d04-3171-2080-6a0e-5a4e96a69951/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"個性豊かなアイドルたちのライブを楽しむリズムゲーム\\n『あんさんぶるスターズ！！Music』\\n\\n初心者から上級者まで楽しめる本格派リズムゲームで、豪華3D演出のMVを心ゆくまで楽しめます。\\n収録楽曲は200曲以上！\\nアイドルや衣装を入れ替えて、あなただけのライブを自由自在に創り上げよう！\\n\\n◆◇ストーリー◇◆\\n新たなアイドル時代の幕開け！\\n全世界の人々に〝アイドルのすべて〟を発信しよう！\\n\\n突如『アンサンブルスクエア』（通称：『ＥＳ』）上空に飛来した天空のワンダーランド・メガスフィア！\\nあなたは四つの芸能事務所に所属する個性弾けるアイドルたちをプロデュースし、　前代未聞の新配信番組『メガストリーム』を手掛けていくことに――\\n\\n胸踊るエンターテイメント、ノンストップのサプライズ\\nアイドル界の新時代は〝ここ〟から始まる！！\\n\\n◆◇クレジット◇◆\\n【タイトル】あんさんぶるスターズ！！Music\\n【ジャンル】男子アイドル育成リズムゲーム\\n【公式サイト】：https://ensemble-stars.jp\\n【公式X】：https://x.com/enstars_music\\n【キャスト】阿座上洋平/浅沼晋太郎/天﨑滉平/石川界人/伊藤マサミ/今井文也/岩崎諒太/内田雄馬/梅原裕一郎/江口拓也/逢坂良太/大須賀純/小野友樹/海渡翼/柿原徹也/笠間淳/梶裕貴/梶原岳人/神尾晋一郎/神永圭佑/北村諒/草野太一/高坂知也/小林大紀/小林千晃/駒田航/斉藤壮馬/榊原優希/重松千晴/鈴木崚汰/諏訪部順一/高橋広樹/武内駿輔/辻史人/土田玲央/照井悠希/豊島修平/鳥海浩輔/中澤まさとも/中島ヨシキ/永塚拓馬/西山宏太朗/新田杏樹/野島健児/橋本晃太朗/羽多野渉/服部想之介/花江夏樹/樋柴智康/比留間俊哉/帆世雄一/細貝圭/前野智昭/増田俊樹/三木眞一郎/緑川光/村瀬歩/森久保祥太郎/山口智広/山下大輝/山本和臣/米内佑希/渡辺拓海\\n\\n◆◇対応環境◇◆\\n【対応機種】iPhone 11 以降（iOS 13 以降）\\n【推奨端末】iPhone 12 以降\\n※対応機種・推奨端末にはApple A13以降搭載のiPad、iPad Pro、iPad Air、iPad miniも含まれます。\\n※ご利用状況によっては正常な挙動とならない場合や、動作が不安定となる場合がございます。\\n※Jailbreak化や不正に改造された端末ではプレイすることができません。\\n※IPv6接続については動作確認ができていないため、非推奨とさせていただいております。\\n\\n◆◇『あんさんぶるスターズ！！Basic』との区別◇◆\\nゲーム性の違う二つのアプリですが、ストーリーやイラストは『Basic』と『Music』どちらも同じものをお届けします。\\n※アプリリニューアル（2020年）以降の追加分のみ。\\n※『Basic』のフェスプロデュースで発生する一部のミニトークとアピールトークは『Basic』でのみご覧いただけます。\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- 細かな改善\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/f0/39/81/f0398146-dec9-6b5d-3155-f9543eb6dcd1/5.5inch_1_M.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/6a/06/21/6a0621c2-7369-1891-9f25-e8a1cdcf7ad5/5.5inch_2__U5171_U901a.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/fc/1e/39/fc1e395f-c3d3-e60a-b95d-a41ea293cebc/5.5inch_3__U5171_U901a.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/a4/b3/c6/a4b3c618-c9f1-846e-7724-3e5a101ec8ef/5.5inch_4_M.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/e6/06/8f/e6068f4e-6379-632a-0f37-41b46a5078e5/5.5inch_5_M.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/b7/d4/1c/b7d41cf2-560b-fd73-5d25-21b9525fa417/5.5inch_6__U5171_U901a.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/4f/f8/04/4ff804c1-325a-1690-f84a-f40c346c8dd3/5.5inch_7_M.png/406x228bb.png\"],\"genres\":[\"ゲーム\",\"ミュージック\",\"アクション\",\"エンターテインメント\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Games\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"無料\"}\n{\"trackId\":6784031888,\"version\":\"1.1.8\",\"trackName\":\"恋愛温度計 - もしもの恋愛シミュレーター\",\"sellerName\":\"Issei Nishi\",\"averageUserRating\":4.52259,\"userRatingCount\":509,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/7b/14/4a/7b144ae0-dd97-e18a-c6c6-a071333b55bf/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"気になるあの人とのトーク、本当はどう思われてる？\\n恋愛温度計は、ふたりのトーク履歴を取り込むだけで“関係の温度”が見えてくる恋愛分析アプリ。\\nさらに「もしも」では、送り方を変えたら相手がどう返すかをAIが予測。今のトークへの返し方の提案や、ふたりの週間レポートも読めます。\\n\\n■ 取り込むだけ、あとは自動で分析\\n・やりとりの量やテンポ、返信の速さ、盛り上がった日をグラフで可視化\\n・ふたりの“関係の温度”をスコアで表示\\n・毎日の小さな変化をやさしくまとめてお知らせ\\n※分析はすべて端末の中だけで完結。相手に通知が届いたり、バレることは一切ありません。\\n\\n■ 「もしも」——あの送信、変えていたら？\\n過去の自分のメッセージを書き換えると、「相手だったらどう返すか」をAIが“もしも”の続きとして予測。\\nさらに「返信を考える」では、今のトークにどう返すかを、あなたの話し方でAIが3案提案します。\\n※実在の相手の発言ではなく、AIによる予測シミュレーションです。\\n\\n■ 週間レポート\\n今週のふたりの温度の変化や気づき、盛り上がった日をまとめて振り返り。\\n相手の好意のサインや“次の一手”は、AIの考察としてプレミアムで読めます。\\n\\n■ こんな人に\\n・好きな人との距離をもう一歩縮めたい\\n・脈ありかどうか、それとなく確かめたい\\n・自分の送り方・返し方を見直したい\\n・恋の駆け引きのヒントがほしい\\n\\n■ プライバシーへの配慮\\n・トーク履歴の分析は端末内で処理します\\n・あなたのトークを第三者に公開することはありません\\n（AIを使う機能〔「もしも」「いまの返事」「週間レポート」〕の利用時のみ、予測・生成のために会話の一部をAIへ送信します。詳しくはプライバシーポリシーをご覧ください）\\n\\n■ 料金について\\n基本機能は無料でご利用いただけます。「もしも」など一部機能は、プレミアム（自動更新サブスクリプション）または単発のチケットでご利用いただけます。\\n・プレミアムでできること：毎日チケットが届く／「いまの返事」を1日にたっぷり使える（無料は1日1回）／週間レポートのAI考察が読める\\n・プレミアム：週額 ¥600 ／ 年額 ¥12,800（自動更新）\\n・お支払いは購入確定時にApple IDへ請求されます。\\n・期間終了の24時間前までに解約しない限り自動更新され、更新分は期間終了前の24時間以内に請求されます。\\n・解約・管理は購入後いつでもApple IDのアカウント設定から行えます。\\n\\nプライバシーポリシー: https://daffy-angle-c7a.notion.site/lovetemp-privacy\\n利用規約: https://daffy-angle-c7a.notion.site/lovetemp-terms\",\"releaseNotes\":\"トーク履歴の共有時・取り込み時の問題を修正しました。\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"ライフスタイル\",\"ユーティリティ\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Lifestyle\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"無料\"}\n{\"trackId\":1247701802,\"version\":\"2.50.0\",\"trackName\":\"神秘のタロットワールド 恋愛・復縁・不倫・人生の当たる占い\",\"sellerName\":\"comdoors\",\"averageUserRating\":4.23025,\"userRatingCount\":1038,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/e1/28/0c/e1280c32-78b3-5781-f1d7-e5f09c1930b8/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-6-0-85-220.jpeg/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"片想い、叶わぬ恋、人生の行き詰まり…1人で抱えきれず苦しんでいませんか？\\n「彼の本当の気持ち」や「あなたの人生の転機」など、誰にも言えない悩みをタロットが解決へ導きます。\\n数々のメディアで活躍する超実力派占い師の本格鑑定を、まずは無料でお試しください。\\n\\n◆あなたに贈る「今日の一枚」（無料）\\n人気占い師が日替わりで登場し、今日のあなたに必要なメッセージを届けます！\\n\\n◆毎日占える！無料鑑定\\n40以上の占いを完全無料でお楽しみいただけます！\\n\\n・あの人は今、この瞬間どうしてる？私のこと想ってる？\\n・今のあなたの恋愛運＋直近の恋のチャンス\\n・今あなたを一番想っている人\\n・大切なあの人が、今抱えている「悩み・望み」とは？\\n・今日、彼があなたを想った瞬間＋妄想したこと\\n・今日のあなたがやってはいけないこと\\n・【毎日の運勢】幸せを呼ぶ９つのメッセージ\\nその他　続々追加予定！\\n\\n◆占いメニュー数1,800以上！\\n恋愛総合運をはじめ、あの人のこと、恋の行方、復活愛、出会い、結婚運、人生運、仕事運など、たくさんの種類の占いメニューがあり、お楽しみいただけます！占いメニューは毎日更新しています。\\n運命の出会いを探している方、転職や仕事で悩んでいる方、人生で悩んでいる方もぜひお試しください！\\n\\n+++【価格】+++\\nアプリダウンロード：無料\\n※一部有料メニューがございます。\\n最安価格：240円　/　最高価格：2500円\\n\\n◆人気の占い師が大集結！\\n「Yahoo!占い」で年間MVP＆売上1位を獲得した、国内屈指の人気占い師から、様々な種類のタロットリーディングを得意とする本格派タロティストがあなたの恋愛、結婚、出会い、人生、仕事などあらゆる悩みを読み解きます！\\n\\n◇Yahoo!占い年間MVP獲得！【林エリヤ】フォルトゥーナタロット\\n◇Yahoo!占い年間売上No.1！大阪心斎橋の凄腕タロット占い師【守田のり子】\\n◇癒されるタロティストと話題！【ジューン澁澤】オーロラタロット\\n◇タロット界の第一人者【伊泉龍一】ラブ・カバラタロット\\n◇陰陽師の式神呪法【高橋圭也】六壬式占タロット\\n◇千里眼が見通す運命【近藤千歳】三摩耶オラクル\\n◇度肝を抜く的中力【hanako】万花易占タロット\\n◇聖母より授かりし奇跡の霊能力【東明瞳光】ホリーマザー・タロット\\n◇ビッグブルー◆グランドブルータロット\\n◇ラビリンス灯子◆イルミナル・タロット\\n◇音山みと◆ディバースタロット\\n◇青木泉蓉◆カマラ・タロット\\n◇ジョアン◆アストロロジータロット\\n◇母のごとき愛情助言【ラーヤ】光輪タロット\\n◇聖樹タロット\\nその他　続々追加予定！\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n◆タロットカードはすべて人気イラストレーターによる完全描き下ろし！\\n美しいカードの絵柄は、見ているだけであなたの心を整え自然と魂を癒してくれます。カード1枚1枚にこめられた神秘的な世界観と力強いメッセージをぜひお受け取りください。\\n\\n◆「プッシュ通知」や「公式LINEアカウント」でアプリの占い更新情報を随時配信します！受信設定して、いち早く情報をお受け取りください！\\n\\n◆こんな方・悩みがある方におすすめ\\n・あの人の本心が知りたい\\n・あの人からどう想われているか占いたい\\n・あの人と結ばれているか、これから結ばれるかを占いたい\\n・将来どうなるのか、2人の運命を占いたい\\n・いつ結婚できるか占いたい\\n・結婚相手がどんな人か気になる\\n・好きな人との相性を占いたい\\n・恋を叶えたいので、アドバイスが欲しい\\n・復縁したい彼とのことを占いたい\\n・彼に好きな人がいるかどうか占いたい\\n・他の人には相談しづらい悩みを占いたい\\n・今の仕事を続けるべきか、転職を考えた方が良いか占いたい\\n・仕事が上手くいかない…どうすればよいかアドバイスが欲しい\\n・人生がなんとなく上手くいかないけど、いつ好転するか占いたい\\n・再婚できるか占いたい\\n・家族のことを占いたい\\n・誕生日や名前などの情報を入力せずに占いたい\\n・気軽に占いたい\\n\\n【ご注意事項】\\n※一部有料のコンテンツがあります。（すべての有料コンテンツは一部無料でご覧いただけます）\\n※一度ご購入された占いを再度される場合は、再度料金が発生いたします。過去の占い結果を再度ご覧になりたい場合は「占い履歴」からご覧くださいませ。\\n※アプリを再インストールされた場合や、異なる端末へ機種変更された場合は、「占い履歴」がすべて消去されますのでご注意くださいませ。（残したい占い結果はスクリーンショットなどをお撮りください）\\n※本アプリはお客様の個人情報の取得はございません。\\n※本アプリはメール登録・情報登録無しでお楽しみいただけますため、退会・解約の必要はございません。\\n\\n【ご利用手順】\\n１・TOP画面などから利用したい占いをタップ\\n２・占い画面中央の「占いスタート」ボタンをタップ\\n３・手順に従い占いを進めていただき「結果を見る（有料）」ボタンをタップ\\n４・課金情報画面にて情報を入力すると結果が表示されます。\\n※無料と表示されている占いは料金がかからずご覧になれます。\\n\\n【推奨環境】\\nOS:iOS9.0以上\\n\\n【対面鑑定のご案内】\\n神秘のタロットワールド～占いLiishaの館～ OPEN！\\nこの度、占いの魅力をより身近に感じていただけるよう、実店舗での対面鑑定サービスを開始いたしました。\\nアプリでは体験できない、占い師と直接対話することで生まれる深い理解と鑑定をぜひご体験ください。\\nご予約は、アプリ内からも受け付けております。ぜひこの機会にご利用ください。\\n詳しくはこちらをご覧下さい。\\nhttps://sp.ddef.jp/stw/taimen.jsp\",\"releaseNotes\":\"■新タロット登場！\\n「運命が色づく万華鏡◆幻彩カレイドスコープタロット 妃彩」をリリースしました！\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"ライフスタイル\",\"エンターテインメント\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Lifestyle\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"無料\"}\n{\"trackId\":6473902336,\"version\":\"1.0.8\",\"trackName\":\"ときめきの恋愛-AIキャラクターとの仮想的な恋愛チャット\",\"sellerName\":\"爽 熊\",\"averageUserRating\":4.40441,\"userRatingCount\":136,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/94/63/e8/9463e826-8d02-59e9-0c04-bb81917fc6a4/AppIcon-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"ときめきの恋愛は情熱とロマンスに満ちた恋愛シミュレーションアプリです。ここでは、ユーザーはAIキャラクターと深くて楽しい対話ができ、リアルで夢中になるような恋愛交流を体験できます。\\n\\n主な機能：\\n\\nAIキャラクターとの対話： アプリ内のAIキャラクターは高度なインテリジェンスを備えた対話システムを持ち、ユーザーの言葉や感情に理解を示し、まるで実際の相手との対話のような体験を提供します。\\n\\n恋愛チャット： ユーザーはさまざまなタイプのAIキャラクターと恋愛対話を展開でき、甘く、情熱的で温かい恋愛の場面を体験できます。AIキャラクターはユーザーの好みや対話に応じて対話内容を調整し、個性的な恋愛シーンを演出します。\\n\\n感情の親密度： ユーザーは持続的な対話を通じてAIキャラクターとの感情の親密度を高め、より深い交流をもたらし、よりリアルな感情を体験できます。\\n\\n個性化体験： アプリはユーザーの個性的な設定をサポートし、外見や性格特徴、好みなどの要素を選択でき、独自の恋愛体験を構築できます。\\n\\n利用規約：https://xindong.funlovemore.top/#/agreementInfo?id=1\\nプライバシーポリシー：https://xindong.funlovemore.top/#/agreementInfo?id=2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Version 1.0.8 では会話例外エラーを修正しました\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/42/12/25/42122547-5a77-f9c7-0586-f526603c6427/d639aa7a-c5c3-4fbf-9abc-cb7b8230df3b__U65e5.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/e5/9f/40/e59f4004-0a32-5103-18f9-fa1a54a3599e/732c5715-5361-4d0e-91f2-30f6c08063da_2.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/56/c4/9a/56c49ad2-6f66-5d65-f518-614615d1ed68/4d9b706d-05ae-489f-a8d9-87e0a0a8b495_3.png/406x228bb.png\"],\"genres\":[\"エンターテインメント\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Entertainment\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"無料\"}\n{\"trackId\":1517761308,\"version\":\"7.2\",\"trackName\":\"こころの悩みや不安を本音で相談できる！-Gift(ギフト)\",\"sellerName\":\"One-DT Co., Ltd.\",\"averageUserRating\":3.95155,\"userRatingCount\":1032,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/0a/3b/7b/0a3b7b1c-fa6d-e39c-ee20-e5a18f18a311/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-sRGB-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"【Gift（ギフト）ってどんなアプリ？】\\n・メンタルが辛い時、オンライン相談ができる\\n・ストレスや鬱、怒りを本音で話すことで悩みを解消できる\\n・質問箱のようなお悩みBOXでストレス発散\\n・うつ病からなどの悩みで死にたい、消えてしまいたいと思ってしまった方の心のカルテに\\n\\nGiftは大人の発達障害、大人のADHDやASD、HSP、繊細さんと呼ばれる方々がチャットや電話で相談できるアプリです。\\n医療機関ではないので、カルテなどの作成はありません。\\n\\n日常生活や仕事、恋愛、家族、パートナー、子供、その他片付けや時間管理、自律神経の不調で生きづらさを感じていたり悩まれている方が、登録されている先生やカウンセラーに本音で相談できるアプリです。\\nまた鬱（うつ病）病やひきこもりでお悩みの方やその保護者様も対象としています。\\n\\nカウンセラー、臨床心理士、就労支援アドバイザー、セラピストその他沢山の先生が登録していますので、日常のストレスやメンタルの悩みをチャットや通話で自分に合う先生に相談をすることができます。\\n\\n\\n【なぜGift（ギフト）が生まれたの？】\\n・自宅から相談、先生を選びたい\\n・どこでもいつでもストレス発散したい\\n・通話だけでなく、チャットでも相談したい\\nこんなご要望から生まれました。\\n\\n現在、日本では、大人の発達障がいと診断される方が増えています。\\nただ、クリニックに通うためには、予約や、移動時間、待ち時間もあり、先生との相性もあります。\\n\\nそこで、「リアル相談からオンライン相談」のご提案です。\\nGIFTのオンライン相談では、自宅から相談できる、先生を選べる、チャットで相談できる、現金不要といったメリットがあります。\\n\\n「いきなりチャットや通話はちょっと、、、」に抵抗のある方は質問箱でお気軽に質問もできます。\\n\\nリアル相談とオンライン相談をバランスよく活用して、鬱病（うつ病）、言いづらい怒り、生きづらさをより緩和、解消して頂けるプラットフォームを提供したいと思い、誕生しました。\\n\\n\\n【Gift（ギフト）はこんな方にオススメ】\\n・アプリだから、カウンセリングやクリニックへの通院の必要なし\\n・寄り添って聞いてもらえる。だからストレスが発散できる\\n・自律神経に不調があるなど、メンタルの悩みから心身が辛い方\\n・認知行動療法を試そうと思っている方\\n・ストレス過多のためストレス測定をしようと思っている方\\n・muuteや知恵袋、googやボックスフレッシュなどのサービスを使ったことがある方\\n・客観的な意見を聞いて自己分析をしたい方\\n・消えてしまいたい死にたいなどの悩みを誰かに相談したい方\\n・自閉症のお子さんの親御さん\\n・双極性うつやの治療に悩みを持っている方\\n・恋愛（男女間）の悩みを抱えている方\\n・ついつい占いに頼ってしまったり占いが好きな方\\n\\nGiftは、大人の発達障がいやADHD、ASD、自閉症スペクトラム、HSP、自律神経の不調、繊細さんにより生きづらさ、しんどさを抱え、それらを解消したい方におすすすめのアプリです。\\n\\nアプリで相談できるので、カウンセリングや心のクリニックに通院する必要がなく簡易に相談できます。\\n\\nお医者さんではないので診断はできないですし健康保険は適用されませんが、寄り添って悩みを聞いてもらえたり、アドバイスをもらえたり、支援や応援をしてもらえるサービスです。\\n\\n鬱病（うつ病）や引きこもりの方も外出する必要がなく、チャットや通話でカウンセリングを受けることができますし、その保護者様も活用ができるので便利。\\nまた、仕事、就職、転職、恋愛、家庭、恋人その他人間関係なんでも本音で相談してみてください。\\n占いよりも実際に相談した方がスッキリ解消することが多いとの意見も多数いただいています。\\n\\n\\n【沢山の先生やカウンセラーが在籍中】\\n・Giftには1,000人以上の先生が登録。\\n・寄り添うコミュニケーションでメンタルの悩みを解消\\n・徹底した管理で先生の質を管理\\n\\nGiftには全国から1,000人以上の先生が登録されています。また、運営事務局では先生には「寄り添うコミュニケーション」を大切にしてもらっています。\\n\\nつまり、「冷たい・怖い・厳しい・怒り・めんどくさそう」といった応対がないように徹底してもらうようにしています。\\n\\n\\n【Gift（ギフト）の使い方は簡単】\\n・アプリをインストールして、プロフィール登録するだけ\\n・「最初はちょっと、、、」という方のためにお悩みBOX（質問箱）\\n・匿名性を維持しつつ、他のユーザーの悩みをチェック\\n\\nアプリをインストールして、プロフィール登録をすれば準備は完了です。登録は無料です。カウンセラーや先生に相談する時は、チャット相談、電話（通話）相談が選択できます。\\n\\n最初はちょっと不安という方向けに、みんなで作る「お悩みBOX（質問箱）」コンテンツを用意しています。\\n匿名性は維持しつつ、他のユーザーがどのような相談をしているのか、先生がどのように回答しているか無料でチェックが可能です。\\n\\nまた、発達障がい関連のNewsを随時更新して共有していますし、先生のタイムラインも日々更新中。登録無料ですので、気軽にご登録くださいませ。\\n\\n\\n\\n【お試しのの無料PTプレゼント！】\\nOpenキャンペーンにつき、お試しの相談用ポイントを全員に無料プレゼント中です。まずは無料で相談して、良いと思えばポイントを購入して是非ご利用くださいませ。\\n\\n\\n【お問い合わせ（アプリ内）】\\nマイページの「ヘルプ」ページ最下部に、お問い合わせ窓口を設置しております。\\n\\n【お問い合わせ（公式サイト）】\\n公式サイトの下記ページからもお問い合わせいただけます。\\nhttps://gift-call.com/contact.php\\n\\n\\n利教規約: https://gift-call.com/terms.php\\nプライバシーポリシー: https://gift-call.com/privacy.php\",\"releaseNotes\":\"軽微な不具合を修正しました\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/28/6e/06/286e0687-ee9e-c107-a336-55f030091fc6/255cfcdb-d211-4967-bc62-ba24268970cd_0925_5.5-1.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/65/5a/cb/655acb0e-cdef-5c05-5994-b5125d0a0b3f/e249ea80-2ffb-4d00-b424-077be50d807e_1019_5.5-4.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/2d/90/7f/2d907f78-00f1-2594-ceb7-7919bebca3c3/aca39abb-da1b-4ae2-bc43-9b6faeeb9e5b_0925_5.5-5-2.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/28/aa/75/28aa751c-ea22-efca-b5a1-ebb3df4f725b/c353add0-4a9d-491c-8bfb-4b22160615bb_0928_5.5-5__U00281_U0029.png/406x228bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/87/0b/78/870b7850-57d5-1952-e049-6baa71370a1b/9920f9e4-92c3-4bc7-aa33-683eea461e88_1019_5.5-3.png/406x228bb.png\"],\"genres\":[\"ヘルスケア／フィットネス\",\"ソーシャルネットワーキング\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"無料\"}\n{\"trackId\":6467590967,\"version\":\"6.0\",\"trackName\":\"チャット占い Clear(クリア) 恋愛・復縁相談アプリ\",\"sellerName\":\"YURI MIND K.K.\",\"averageUserRating\":4.22513,\"userRatingCount\":191,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/46/41/ec/4641eca9-3ce4-f85e-bc3f-ab0b8a736901/AppIcon2-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-sRGB-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"＼初回無料ポイント付き（まずは気軽にはじめよう）／\\n元恋人との復縁・不倫・片思いはClearクリアに相談\\n寄り添い鑑定で貴方の悩みをクリアにします\\n\\n\\n＜24時間匿名OK＞\\n【こんな方にオススメ】\\n◯元カレとヨリを戻したくて悩んでる…\\n◯大好きな恋人と喧嘩した…\\n◯夫が不倫していてどうすればいいかわからない…\\n◯悩みを話せる友達がいない…\\nなど、お悩みを抱えてる方は是非クリアのカウンセラーさんにご相談ください！\\n\\n\\n【クリアは安心安全】\\n◯料金前払い制なので使いすぎることはありません！\\n◯鑑定師さんは全員本人確認済み！\\n◯クチコミとレビューを見てから鑑定師さんを選べる！\\n◯個人情報の入力は任意。相談時だけでもOK！\\n◯お問い合わせ窓口から経験豊富な運営スタッフがサポート！\\n\\n\\n【クリアの使い方3ステップ】\\n◯ステップ1\\n鑑定師さんのプロフィール・メッセージ・クチコミから、あなたの相談内容が得意な鑑定師さんを探そう！\\n◯ステップ2\\n気になる鑑定師さんがいたらメッセージを送って送ってみよう！\\n「相談お願いします」やスタンプだけでもOK！\\n◯ステップ3\\n具体的に相談してみよう！\\n相手は話を聞くプロなので胸を借りるつもりで相談してください！\\n\\n\\n【ご利用にあたって】\\nクリアをご利用いただくにあたって、アプリ内に設置している利用規約に同意いただいた上、アプリをご利用ください。\\nクリアで活動されている鑑定師さんの回答は将来の予測やユーザー様の意志決定を縛ったり強制するものではございません。\\n公序良俗に反する書き込みは、発見次第投稿内容の削除および会員資格の停止措置等をとらせて頂く場合がございます。\\nクリアに関するお問い合わせは、アプリ内のお問い合わせフォームよりご連絡ください。\\n\\n\\n＜運営者＞\\n運営会社：ユーリマインド株式会社\\n住所：大阪府大阪市中央区瓦屋町1丁目-5-15 5F\",\"releaseNotes\":\"軽微な不具合を修正しました\",\"screenshotUrls\":[\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/db/5d/b5/db5db543-de0d-3e55-70fa-d3cd3644c57d/aa1482da-82c8-4d96-8e65-e26c697a9e3b_1242_U00d72208_1.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/6c/d9/bd/6cd9bd07-0c5e-3acb-db07-61865726f51d/f62cef8c-a390-4bfb-a94d-ee190a0832e5_1242_U00d72208_2.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/d5/5f/c1/d55fc13c-0a1b-7260-0a62-4068d84e8d17/b6e2c78a-5686-4947-ae71-b96f8b3a8470_1242_U00d72208_3.png/392x696bb.png\",\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/34/c1/99/34c199d0-2c74-9b0f-bd5a-c04e8362a34e/a2afb76a-290e-4773-aa51-04956f139fbc_1242_U00d72208_4.png/392x696bb.png\"],\"genres\":[\"教育\",\"ヘルスケア／フィットネス\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Education\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"無料\"}\nFILE:/Users/anicca/anicca/skills/earn/marketing-engine/evidence/intel/pulls/68f5220fe826411ab0d41408bda1f09e/apple.owned-apps-jp.json\n{\"trackId\":6755129214,\"version\":\"1.9.4\",\"trackName\":\"毎日のアファメーション - アニッチャ\",\"sellerName\":\"Daisuke Narita\",\"averageUserRating\":4.5,\"userRatingCount\":46,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/b8/52/0f/b8520fcc-2a23-b0a9-3ce9-8a3722f9164b/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"あなたが本当に必要な瞬間に、優しい言葉が届くアファメーション。\\n\\nアニッチャ（Anicca）は、AIによるセルフケア・コンパニオン。自己肯定、引き寄せ（マニフェステーション）、心の平和の言葉を、美しいカードと通知で、心が揺れ始める\\\"その瞬間\\\"に届けます。\\n\\n多くのアファメーション・アプリは、自分でアプリを開いて読まなければなりません。アニッチャは違います。あなたの一日を学び — 夜更かししそうな時、自己否定が始まりそうな時、不安が忍び寄る時 — その瞬間にひとつの優しい言葉を届けます。タップすればカード全文。読むだけで、少し心が軽くなる。\\n\\n## アニッチャが違う理由\\n\\n- アファメーションは「思い出した時」ではなく「必要な時」に届く\\n- AIがあなたの心に響く言葉を学習する\\n- 仏教の「無常（アニッチャ）」に根ざした設計 — どんな嵐もいつか過ぎ去る\\n- ストリーク・罪悪感・生産性プレッシャーは一切なし\\n- すでに自分を責めすぎている人のために作られた\\n\\n## 主な機能\\n\\n### ◆ 毎日のアファメーション・カード\\n美しくデザインされたカードに、自己肯定の言葉、引き寄せのプロンプト、セルフラブのリマインダー — 今日のあなたに合わせて選ばれます。\\n\\n### ◆ スマート・タイミング\\nアニッチャはあなたのパターンを学習。夜中のスクロール？23:47にカードが届きます。自己批判のループ？内なる批判者が動き出した瞬間にカードが現れます。\\n\\n### ◆ 13のセルフケア・テーマ\\n自己愛・不安の緩和・考えすぎを手放す・怒りを鎮める・自信のマニフェステーション・自己疑念の解放・赦し・過去を手放す・孤独・先延ばし・誠実な言葉・健全な境界線・眠りの平和。\\n\\n### ◆ ボイス・セッション\\n話したい時に話せる。穏やかなAIの声があなたの言葉を受け止め、自己慈悲に根ざした視点を返します — アドバイスでも治療でもなく、ただ\\\"そばに居る\\\"。\\n\\n### ◆ 適応学習\\n心に響いたカードは優先され、響かなかったものは自然に消えていきます。日々、あなたの\\\"フィード\\\"はあなた自身に近づきます。\\n\\n### ◆ 優しい、決して責めない\\n途切れたら罪悪感、というストリークはありません。「昨日サボったね」も言いません。コーチではなく、優しい友人のように現れます。\\n\\n## こんな方へ\\n\\n- 無理にポジティブでいるのに疲れた人\\n- 自己批判・燃え尽き・不安から回復している人\\n- アファメーション・引き寄せが好きで、ToDoではなく日常に溶け込ませたい人\\n- 自分との関係を、もっと静かで、もっと優しくしたい人\\n\\n## 哲学\\n\\n「アニッチャ（Anicca）」は仏教のパーリ語で「無常」を意味します — どんな感情も、どんな思考も、どんな嵐も、永遠ではないという真理。届く一通の通知は、その小さなリマインダーです。あなたは\\\"最悪の瞬間\\\"のあなたではない。これもまた過ぎ去る。\\n\\n## 利用情報\\n\\nプライバシーポリシー: https://aniccaai.com/privacy\\n利用規約 (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\\n\\n### サブスクリプション情報（自動更新）\\n\\n- タイトル: Anicca Pro（月額/年額）\\n- 期間: 1か月 / 1年\\n- 価格: 端末の購入画面に表示される金額が適用されます\\n\\n免責事項：アニッチャはセルフケア・ウェルネスアプリです。医学的な診断、治療、またはアドバイスを提供するものではありません。コンテンツは情報提供およびモチベーション目的のみです。健康上の懸念がある場合や、心身の健康に関する判断を行う前に、必ず医療専門家にご相談ください。\",\"releaseNotes\":\"不具合の修正とパフォーマンスの改善。\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"ヘルスケア／フィットネス\",\"ライフスタイル\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Health & Fitness\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"無料\"}\n{\"trackId\":6759667221,\"version\":\"1.0.3\",\"trackName\":\"本音翻訳\",\"sellerName\":\"Daisuke Narita\",\"averageUserRating\":5,\"userRatingCount\":2,\"url\":null,\"artworkUrl100\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/ef/f0/a6/eff0a6d3-a74d-7ec0-f6ee-93c83506f292/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\"description\":\"LINEや会話文を貼り付けるだけで、相手の本当の気持ちをAIが即分析。\\n\\n怒り・不安・寂しさ・期待…隠された感情を読み解き、関係を壊さない最適な返答まで具体的に提案します。\\n\\n- 無料: 1日3回まで\\n- プレミアム: 翻訳無制限 + 全履歴 + 優先高速分析 + 詳細な心理分析\\n\\n対応する関係性:\\n* 恋人・カップル\\n* 友人\\n* 家族\\n* 同僚・上司\\n\\n利用規約: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\",\"releaseNotes\":\"edited the ai url so honne ai can properly analyze honne!\",\"screenshotUrls\":[],\"genres\":[\"ユーティリティ\"],\"primaryGenreName\":\"Utilities\",\"price\":0.0,\"formattedPrice\":\"無料\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
